INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(25,'u7e0ee592-95cd-432f-acc4-1061ccd30eea','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2016 Honda Civic LX Sedan (Low Poly)','The Honda Civic is a compact car manufactured by Honda. Honda unveiled the 2016 Civic sedan in September 16th 2015; variants include sedan, coup, 5-door hatchback, Si trims, and Type-R models. The sedan''s wheelbase is 1.2 inches longer. Two I4 engines are available, a naturally aspired 2.0-liter DOHC paired to either a 6-speed manual or CVT transmission and a turbocharged 1.5-liter DOHC motor. The Civic utilizes higher grade steels. The unit body is 68 pounds lighter than in the previous model, the exterior has standard LED DRLs (which are optional) and C-shaped LED tailights, and the rear disc brakes are made standard. I made this using the leaked patent drawings as blueprints and the official and other sources'' images as main references. It took me three full days (Including today) to make it. I used parts from another Civic I imported before (2012 Coup SI) and the mirrors from a 2015 Hyundai Sonata I''m working on, so some parts aren''t exactly accurate as the real car. Hope you all like it and leave a comment.(Update as of 21/09/15: Fixed minor polygon errors on both front and rear windshields, mainly where they are split in half, the presentation for said parts look better now.)(Update as of 17/10/15: Small fixes, corrections & modifications; complete grouping and body recolor to official Aegean Blue Metallic paint. By the way, as soon as the new Civic Coup is presented, It''ll be very possible that I''ll make it from this model!)(Update as of 1/12/16: Some fixes and corrections, added a few missing details, body & wheels recolor)',NULL,'honda','2016','civic',4.666939496994020332,2.183908224105830076,1.438276290893550025,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/u7e0ee592-95cd-432f-acc4-1061ccd30eea/2016-Honda-Civic-LX-Sedan-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(26,'a4a26575235e434694db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Toyota Verso-S/Ractis (Low Poly)','The Toyota Verso-S or Ractis in Japan is a mini MPV made by Toyota. The second generation Ractis was unveiled at the 2010 Paris Motor Show as the Toyota Verso-S. The Ractis is produced at the Iwate plant by Kanto Auto Works. The introduction of the Verso-S will mark the re-entry of Toyota into the European B-MPV segment. When it hits the market, the Verso-S will have the shortest overall length of any MPV in its class in Europe. The Verso-S is available with a choice of two engines, a 1.33-liter gasoline unit or a 1.4-liter D-4D turbo diesel, both mated to a 6-speed manual gearbox. The gasoline derivative is also offered with an optional, Multidrive S, automatic continuously variable transmission (CVT), which features a 7-speed, sequential paddle shift mode. The gasoline model delivers a combined fuel economy of 5.5 lt/100 km [42.8 mpg US] and CO2 emissions of 127 g/km, and the diesel model, 4.3 lt/100 km [54.7 mpg US] and 113 g/km respectively. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file; I improved it from what it originally was. Hope you all like it and leave a comment.(Big update as of 25/10/15: Complete makeover; cleaner lines, lots of editing & fixing, made missing details like grille inserts & detailing, and added details from existing models like the door handles; lots of softening and mesh cleaning, complete regrouping, new paint color, changed scale (from 1.00 to 10.00; for better editing experience), and many other things.)','triangles','toyota','2010','ractis',4.489202499389650214,2.217646598815920189,1.784112765857569949,NULL,NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a4a26575235e434694db926ad0cd7381/2010-Toyota-VersoSRactis-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(27,'318cd080dba5dc4a94db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Mitsubishi Outlander Sport/RVR/ASX (Low Poly)','The Mitsubishi Outlander Sport/RVR/ASX is a compact crossover made by Mitsubishi. It was first released in the Japanese domestic market on February 17, 2010. In Europe, Australia, Jamaica and Latin America it is sold as the Mitsubishi ASX (an abbreviation of Active Sports Crossover), and as the Mitsubishi Outlander Sport in the United States. In Canada it is sold as the Mitsubishi RVR, while in Puerto Rico it keeps both the ASX and Outlander Sport titles as well. It is based on the design of the Mitsubishi Concept-cX prototype first exhibited at the 62nd Frankfurt Motor Show in July 2007. It is a return to the original concept of offering the platform used for the longer Mitsubishi Outlander with reduced seating capacity to five people, while sharing components of the longer vehicle, demonstrating a corporate decision to return Mitsubishi to smaller, fuel efficient vehicles in favor of larger, truck-based products. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. I improved it considerably as from it was originally. Hope you all like it and leave a comment.(Big update as of 19/10/15: Complete makeover; cleaner lines, lots of editing & fixing, made missing details like side skirts and roof rails from scratch and added details from existing models like the door handles, lots of softening and mesh cleaning, complete regrouping, new paint color, changed scale (from 1.00 to 10.00; for better editing experience), and many other things.)','triangles','mitsubishi','2011','outlander sport',4.180090427398679865,2.059134483337400123,1.582023818977180029,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/318cd080dba5dc4a94db926ad0cd7381/2011-Mitsubishi-Outlander-SportRVRASX-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(28,'u0c74ef28-b0ac-401f-810e-1b399da97e49','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2014 Volkswagen Golf SportsVan/SV (Low Poly)','The Volkswagen Golf SportsVan is a compact MPV produced by Volkswagen since 2014. Based on the VW Sportvan concept shown at the 2013 Frankfurt Motor Show and sold as the Sportsvan in many markets, it uses the VW Group MQB platform shared by many of Volkswagen''s range. The Golf SV is the third variant of the seventh-generation Golf, alongside the hatchback and the Estate, and has a look that clearly follows the design of its siblings, with strong elements of Volkswagens design DNA. At 4,338 mm long, the new SV is 134 mm longer than the Golf Plus that it replaces, and 83 mm longer than the Golf. It is 224 mm shorter than the Golf Estate. A first for the Golf SV is a blind spot monitor, dubbed Side Scan, with an assistant for exiting parking spaces. This monitors the area behind and to the sides of the vehicle, ensuring easier and safer egress when reversing from a parking bay. It will be packaged as an option together with Lane Assist. Powering the SV is a range of petrol and diesel engines, all of which incorporate Stop/Start and battery regeneration systems. There are two turbocharged 1.2-litre petrol engines with 85 and 110 PS; two 1.4-litre turbocharged petrol engines with 125 and 150 PS; and three turbodiesels: a 2.0-litre 150 PS, a 1.6-litre 90 PS and a 1.6-litre 110 PS. When fitted in the Golf SV BlueMotion, this last engine is expected to return fuel economy of 76.3 mpg and emit 95 g/km of CO2. All engines apart from the 1.2-litre TSI 85 PS can be ordered with a DSG gearbox.I''m proud to announce that this is my very first production car made entirely from blueprints/scratch; it took 4 days to be made. Of course it doesn''t look exactly perfect, but i''m pretty much happy with the final result. I''ll be making more production cars using this method, but for now i''ll be practicing with cars with simple lines, like this VW. Wheels by both Alabassiry and me. Hope you all like it and leave a comment.(Update as of 18/10/15: Made general improvements to the body geometry, added missing body lines, made taillight textures (which to be honest weren''t made because of laziness), made some fixes and complete regrouping.)(Update as of 19/10/15: More (and hopefully final) polygon fixes, mainly where the side skirts are located.)',NULL,'volkswagen','2014','golf',4.600257396697999824,2.183908224105830076,1.701073050498959959,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/u0c74ef28-b0ac-401f-810e-1b399da97e49/2014-Volkswagen-Golf-SportsVanSV-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(29,'u23e28250-c409-4ceb-931b-08474a19ea65','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2015 Mazda 2/Demio 5-Door (DJ) (Low Poly)','The Mazda2 or Demio is a supermini manufactured by Mazda. In July 2014, Mazda officially revealed photos of the fourth generation Demio hatchback, and production began at Mazda''s Hfu plant. It was previewed by the Mazda Hazumi Concept, unveiled at the 2014 Geneva Motor Show. The fourth generation is based on a variation of Mazda''s CX-5 platform, rather than Ford''s DE platform used on the Ford Fiesta, and features greater length, wider front and rear tracks, decreased interior room for rear-seat occupants and less front head and legroom. The Mazda2 uses Mazda''s SkyActiv-Drive automatic and SkyActiv-MT manual gearboxes, as well as stop-start technology (i-STOP turns the engine off when the car is stationary) and a brake energy regeneration system (i-ELOOP uses braking to charge a capacitor for all car electronics, in place of an alternator charging a battery). The Mazda2 will initially be offered with a 1.5-litre petrol engine and a 1.5-litre diesel engine  the SkyActiv-D 1.5 diesel engine debuted at the 2014 Geneva Motor Show. The petrol engine will be available with 74 bhp, 89 bhp or 113 bhp, while the diesel will produce 104 bhp.I made this using blueprints found on the internet, some parts are sourced from a high poly 2015 Mazda3, which I polygon reduced by myself to keep the polycount low. Wheels are from my CX-5 model. Took me two days to finish it. Hope you all like it and leave a comment.',NULL,'mazda','2015','demio',4.335327625274659979,2.183907866477969862,1.54814660549163996,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/u23e28250-c409-4ceb-931b-08474a19ea65/2015-Mazda-2Demio-5Door-DJ-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(30,'uc34f46a0-9710-4d8b-88a1-6428fd35a977','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2015 Geely Borui GC9 (Low Poly)','The Geely/Emgrand Borui GC9 is a mid-size luxury car produced by Geely. The Geely GC9 draws on the KC Concept that was unveiled at the Shanghai Auto Show in April 2013. The design was penned by Peter Horbury, the former Volvo designer who was named chief designer at Geely in 2012. The Emgrand marque is now defunct although the Emgrand GC9 becomes Geely GC9. There are three petrol engines available for the GC9, which include a 1.8-liter turbocharged with direct fuel injection (180 hp and 285 Nm), 2.4-liter aspirated (160 hp and 210 Nm) and 3.5-liter V6 (270 hp and 345 Nm). All three engines are mated to a 6-speed automatic transmission, developed independently by Geely.It was imported from an .obj file, and the file itself was imported from Asphalt 8: Airborne (thanks to GameModels.ru for the original model). I cleaned up the overall model, removed panel gaps, regrouped everything, added new materials, and made some edits and fixes. Hope you all like it and leave a comment.',NULL,'geely','2015','borui',4.969367265701290392,2.183908104896549852,1.527816772460939943,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/uc34f46a0-9710-4d8b-88a1-6428fd35a977/2015-Geely-Borui-GC9-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(31,'u6458feb2-9cd5-42df-8c19-d62b23b638f9','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2015 McLaren 650S Coup (Low Poly)','The McLaren 650S is a supercar designed and manufactured by McLaren Automotive. It was announced in February 2014 as a new model, but based on the existing McLaren MP4-12C with 25% new parts, and was formally unveiled at the 2014 Geneva Motor Show. The 650S shares the MP4-12C''s carbon fibre composite chassis, and is powered by the same McLaren M838T 3.8-litre V8, twin-turbo engine, but now developing 641 bhp (478 kW; 650 PS) and 500 lbft (680 Nm) of torque. Power is transmitted to the wheels through a seven-speed near instantaneous shift dual-clutch gearbox. The 650S has a claimed top speed of 333 km/h (207 mph), and can accelerate from 0100 km/h (062 mph) in 3 seconds and from 0200 km/h (0124 mph) in 8.4 seconds.Imported from an .obj file and the file itself was imported from CSR Racing (thanks to GameModels.ru for the original model), I cleaned up the overall model, removed panel gaps, regrouped everything, added new materials, and made more important edits and fixes. Hope you all like it.',NULL,'mclaren','2015','650s coupe',4.789587497711179864,2.183908224105830076,1.281683802604679955,'orange',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/u6458feb2-9cd5-42df-8c19-d62b23b638f9/2015-McLaren-650S-Coup-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(32,'dfa922f1c10441ddbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2006 Renault Clio III Phase I (Low Poly)','The Renault Clio is a supermini made by Renault. An all-new third generation Clio was unveiled at the 2005 Frankfurt Motor Show. The Clio III uses the Nissan B platform, co-developed with Nissan (which Renault has a share in), that is shared with the Renault Modus, the current Nissan Micra and the Nissan Note. It is considerably larger and 130 kg (287 lb) heavier as well as more expensive than the Clio II, and at nearly 4000 mm in length has almost outgrown the supermini class. This car was originally a template that came with it''s higher poly counterpart, i did most of the detailing, added badges and wheels from the higher poly version, and other remaining details. As said previously, all made by me. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #clio #euroclio #french #good #looking #lutecia #phase_i #renault #small #supermini #xrw960h','matte glass','renault','2006','clio',4.092685937881469727,1.858628630638119895,1.560602799057960067,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/dfa922f1c10441ddbe40bb45ea25a041/2006-Renault-Clio-III-Phase-I-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(33,'b0c9f56f174a294ba658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Toyota 86/GT 86 GTLimited (Low Poly)','The Toyota GT 86 is a compact sports car developed by Toyota and Subaru. The GT 86 will be sold as the Toyota 86 in Japan, South Africa and Australia and Toyota GT86 in Europe, as the Subaru BRZ worldwide and as the Scion FR-S in the American market. The 86 refers to the Toyota Corolla Levin series AE86 and the Toyota Sprinter Trueno series AE86, a particular series of cars sold between 1983 and 1987 (both the Levin and Trueno were available in coupe and hatchback bodystyles). As such, the Toyota 86 has been named as the spiritual successor of the original AE86 during the press release of the 86. I 100% made this in Blender 2.49b, from a model i imported of it, using the Polygon Reducer add-on that it included. It has elements from the high poly version, like the wheels, mirrors and wheels. Please rate! #86 #ae86 #auto #automobile #brz #car #corolla #coupe #frs #gt86 #levin #racing #scion #sports #stylish #subaru #toyota #trueno #xrw960h','triangles','toyota','2013',NULL,3.921844482421870115,1.854853510856629973,1.327919361399839904,NULL,NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/b0c9f56f174a294ba658426ef34a90c8/2013-Toyota-86GT-86-GTLimited-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(34,'88aae5646dcad7062a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Chevrolet Cruze LTZ Sedan','Badged Holden Cruze in Australasia and Daewoo Lacetti Premiere (from 2008 to 2011) in South Korea, the new generation model does not serve as a replacement for its identically badged predecessor, but rather replaces the Chevrolet Cobalt and Daewoo Lacetti compact sedans. GM phased out production of the Chevrolet Cobalt and its badge engineered counterpart, the Pontiac G5 in 2010, on the introduction of the Chevrolet Cruze in North America. Original by 3dmodders. I converted it from .kmz to Sketchup and colored everything and fixed some things. Please rate! #auto #car #chevrolet #compact #cruze #daewoo #holden #lacetti #premiere #sedan #xrw960h',NULL,'chevrolet','2011','cruze',5.081537723541259765,2.183908224105830076,1.666063904762270064,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/88aae5646dcad7062a9eb0f146e94477/2011-Chevrolet-Cruze-LTZ-Sedan',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(35,'5be79b1758410803be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Ford Fiesta .move','The Ford Fiesta is a subcompact or supermini made by Ford Motor Company. In early 2010 the Fiesta was facelifted as a 2011 model, with new headlights and grille, very similar to those on the mark VI Fiesta available in other markets around the world, but keeping all other features nearly the same as the previous model. Its name varies from country to country, called Fiesta One in Argentina, Fiesta Move in Venezuela, and Fiesta Rocam in Brazil. In Venezuela it is sold with a 1.6 I4 engine with 97hp, automatic 4-speed and manual 5-speed transmission. It is sold since June 2010 in Venezuela. Also, this car is on the top 5 of the best-selling cars on Venezuela. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Please rate! @#J@IM_n3$#: Gracias! Me costo mucho para hacer que este carro quedara debajo de los 10MB! @NENTAUTAKO: To be honest, yes. If you see this car in person, however, it doesn''t look that ugly. #american #auto #automobile','matte glass','ford','2011','fiesta',4.118519783020020419,2.187881231307979845,1.812427551019939908,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/5be79b1758410803be40bb45ea25a041/2011-Ford-Fiesta-move',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(36,'5ace8798a57fcf309aa387dd568006ae','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Hyundai ix20','The Hyundai ix20 is a mini MPV produced Hyundai. The ix20 debuted at the 2010 Paris Auto Show. The car is built on the same platform as the Hyundai i20, Kia Venga, and Kia Soul. The ix20 employs Hyundai''s new Fluidic Sculpture design language. This automobile is currently sold exclusively in Europe. It is manufactured at Hyundai''s Motor Manufacturing Czech in Noovice. I found this in a Zmodeler file, and the model is ripped from Forza Motorsport 4. I improved it a lot. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #design #fluidic #hyundai #ix20 #korean #mini_mpv #multi #purpose #sculpture #small #sporty #vehicle #xrw960h',NULL,'hyundai','2012','ix20',4.262280941009519708,2.075541853904720125,1.870170950889590066,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/5ace8798a57fcf309aa387dd568006ae/2012-Hyundai-ix20',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(37,'2c3629b75f4dbfc494db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Audi A4 B8 Facelift (Low Poly)','The Audi A4 is a compact executive car produced by Audi since 1994 to present. The new facelifted A4 features redesigned LED headlamps and tail lights, front air dam with fog lamps, and closely set twin exhausts. Interior changes include a three-spoke steering wheel and a redesigned ignition key. Controls for air-conditioning, infotainment, and power windows gain chrome clasps. The A4 includes radio with eight speakers as standard, while MMI navigation system with voice dialogue is optional. A new Drive Select System allows drivers to choose comfort, dynamic, individual, or efficiency modes for fuel efficiency. Power output of the 1.8 TFSI engine is 170 BHP and 320 Nm of torque  up 10 BHP and 70 Nm from the previous versions. Electro-mechanical power steering is standard. This was originally the 2008 model, but i edited a lot to make it look like the current one. The wheels are from a S4. Please rate! (Update as of 01/05/13: Added headlight units, fixed small details on the headlights glasses; Update as of 30/09/13: Replaced old headlight units with those made by DennisP, car color change)','matte glass','audi','2013','a4',4.816387176513670099,2.037345409393310103,1.451343655586240011,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/2c3629b75f4dbfc494db926ad0cd7381/2013-Audi-A4-B8-Facelift-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(38,'11c07009c6756df094db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Audi A4 B8 (Low Poly)','The Audi A4 is a compact executive car produced by Audi since 1994 to present. Audi released the first official pictures of the B8 series A4 in August 2007, and unveiled the car to the public at the September 2007 Frankfurt Motor Show. Saloon/sedan and Avant (estate/wagon) models are offered. The Avant was unveiled to the public at the March 2008 Geneva Motor Show. The B8 A4 is built on a variant of the Audi Modular Longitudinal Platform, a platform which is also used in the Audi A5 coup. Whilst prior A4 chassis were limited in wheelbase due to the relationship between the engine, transmission and front axle, the MLP allows for a reduced front overhang, resulting in a greater wheelbase length without the same increase in overall length. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. Also, i used this to make the facelifted one. Please rate, and happy new year 2013! #a4 #audi #auto #automobile #car #compact #executive #german #luxury #sedan #wagon #xrw960h','matte glass','audi','2008','a4',4.704183578491210049,1.996710121631620095,1.422396302223210007,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/11c07009c6756df094db926ad0cd7381/2008-Audi-A4-B8-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(39,'uefe329c1-efc1-412d-8d6f-9f083f0b1cb6','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2014 Toyota FT-1 Concept (Low Poly)','The Toyota FT-1 is a concept car made by Toyota, and it was unveiled at the January 2014 North American International Auto Show. ''FT'' stands for Future Toyota, while ''1'' means number one or the ultimate one. Little is known about this new concept car; other than that it has a front engine and rear wheel drive layout. Toyota did also state their new concept car draws inspiration from Toyota''s past sports cars like the 2000GT, Supra, MR-2, and 2007 FT-HS concept car. Toyota did not state whether the FT-1 would use the Supra name, or if it was even bound for production. However, Toyota did say if the FT-1 is approved from production to expect a price tag of around US$60,000.Imported from an .obj file (thanks to GameModels.ru for the original model), grouped everything, made important edits to the front headlights and wheels, added some small design details (mainly red accents found on the front headlights and wheels), made the door and rear quarter windows from scratch, and added badges and front bumper fans. Hope you all like it.',NULL,'toyota','2014','ft-1',5.181695699691769797,2.183907985687259857,1.38868451118468994,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/uefe329c1-efc1-412d-8d6f-9f083f0b1cb6/2014-Toyota-FT1-Concept-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(40,'b2c489717807a35f59fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1994 Toyota Carina ED (Low Poly)','The Toyota Carina ED is a compact car made by Toyota. It was created in 1985 as a companion to the 1984 Carina sedan. It was positioned as the 4-door Celica, with a similar focus on luxury found on larger Toyota hardtop sedans, like the Toyota Crown and the Toyota Cresta. When the Carina ED was discontinued, the Toyota Brevis appeared for the market segment served by the Carina ED. The four wheel drive system introduced on this generation was borrowed from the Toyota Celica GT-Four. The 3S-GE engine as a result did not have four wheel steering. The trim level designations were 1800V, 2000X, 2000GT and 2000GT-4WD. As a result of styling changes, sales improved in comparison to the second generation. A driver side airbag appeared September 1995, as well as speed sensitive door locks and climate control air conditioning. A passenger side airbag appeared June 1996. Production ended due to economic conditions April 1998. Imported from a GTA SA file using ZModeler 2. I improved a lot the original model. And i''m back after an one month break. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment.','matte glass','toyota','1994','carina',4.344199657440189987,1.820060491561890092,1.259315273724499918,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/b2c489717807a35f59fdb5e89c581117/1994-Toyota-Carina-ED-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(41,'a39bca78620927e459fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2003 Toyota Probox (Low Poly)','The Toyota Probox is a compact station wagon/van produced by Toyota. The Toyota Probox was introduced by Toyota for the Japanese market in August 2002. It is a small station wagon designed for commercial use as a delivery vehicle. The car is also closely related to the Toyota Succeed. It is used with a left-hand drive conversion extensively as a taxi throughout Peru, Bolivia and as right-hand drive in Myanmar (particularly in Yangon where the streets are inundated with Probox taxis.). I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. I improved it a lot by deleting unnecessary elements and using less materials. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment. #auto #automobile #car #commercial #compact #japanese #probox #small #station #toyota #van #wagon #xrw960h',NULL,'toyota','2003','probox',4.823531389236450196,2.183908224105830076,1.751629114151000088,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a39bca78620927e459fdb5e89c581117/2003-Toyota-Probox-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(42,'9d11f0d0b674047659fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2014 Jaguar F-Type Convertible V8 S (Low Poly)','The Jaguar F-Type is a two-seat sports car made by Jaguar. The F-Type was first previewed as a hybrid electric coup, the C-X16 Concept that was unveiled at the 2011 Frankfurt motor show on 13th of September. The convertible version of F-Type was first revealed in Sundance, London which was followed by a presentation at the 2012 Paris Motor Show. Initial F-Type convertible models include the F-Type (340 PS), F-Type S (380 PS) and F-Type V8 S (495 PS). The F-Type is the successor to the famous E-Type and it is based on a shortened platform of the XK. The F-Type uses an all-aluminium chassis, sound and vibration insulation is provided by the addition of a special underbody tray and engine mounts, and a double bulkhead between the engine bay and passenger compartment. The convertible roof is an electrically operated retractable fabric hood. Jaguar says by eschewing metal it can keep the cars centre of gravity low, while a Thinsulate layer means thermal and sound insulation is akin to a solid roof. Imported from an .obj file and the file itself was imported from CSR Racing (thanks a lot to GameModels.ru for the original model), and i''ve considerably improved it a lot from the original model, removed panel gaps, regrouped everything, added new materials, made logos and made other minor but important edits. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment.',NULL,'jaguar','2014','f-type',4.506747484207149767,2.183907985687259857,1.344694018363949973,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/9d11f0d0b674047659fdb5e89c581117/2014-Jaguar-FType-Convertible-V8-S-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(43,'4eb9c5f15abe8b5e59fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Dodge Magnum R/T (Low Poly)','The Dodge Magnum is a full-size station wagon produced by Chrysler. The Magnum name was revived in 2004 as a 2005 station wagon on the Chrysler LX platform. The new Magnum was a badge engineered station wagon version of the Chrysler 300 manufactured at the same plant in Brampton, Ontario, Canada. The Magnum is the last mid-size station wagon (140 to 160 cubic feet of combined passenger and cargo volume) sold by an American automobile manufacturer in the United States, though Chrysler marketed the Chrysler 300 Touring variant in Europe and Australia. The Magnum had four engine options; the SE features the 190 hp 2.72 L LH V6, the SXT had the 250 hp (190 kW) 3.5 L V6, and the RT had the new 340 hp 5.7 L Hemi V8. The SRT-8 has a 425 hp 6.1 L Hemi engine. All-wheel drive became an option in 2005 on SXT and RT models. The SRT8, AWD SXT, and the RT use a Mercedes-Benz-derived 5-speed automatic transmission, while all other models use a four-speed automatic. Imported from NFS: Hot Pursuit (2010) using ZModeler 2. Fitted with Charger wheels as the original model didn''t had any wheels. There''s also a higher poly model which i may upload later. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment. EDIT:GTFO ANONYMOUS.',NULL,'dodge','2008','magnum',5.311093330383299893,2.183907985687259857,1.767233967781070004,'black',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/4eb9c5f15abe8b5e59fdb5e89c581117/2008-Dodge-Magnum-RT-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(44,'508d4a1efd22f70b59fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Volkswagen Polo TSI Comfortline MK5 5-Door (6R) (Low Poly)','The Volkswagen Polo is a supermini produced by Volkswagen. Volkswagen launched the fifth generation Polo (internal designation Typ 6R) at the Geneva Motor Show in March 2009. It shares its platform with the 2008 SEAT Ibiza Mk4 and the Audi A1. Production for the UK market started in summer 2009, with first deliveries in October 2009. Official images released show the new Polo follows styling cues from the Golf VI. The Polo Mark V is 44 mm longer and 32 mm wider and sits 13 mm lower to the road than the previous generation Polo. Boot capacity is increased by 10 litres to 280 litres of storage space with 952 litres with the seats folded down. The car is 7.5% lighter than its predecessor. The Polo has thorax airbags and has been awarded a five-star Euro NCAP crash impact rating. The Volkswagen Polo won the 2010 European Car of the Year, defeating the Toyota iQ and Opel/Vauxhall Astra. The European version, with exceptions for the French and Turkish market, includes a standard ESP electronic stabilization program with Hill Hold Control, head-thorax airbags (integrated in the front seatbacks), belt tensioners and belt force limiters plus seatbelt warning indicator and head restraints, three rear head restraints and Isofix child seat preparation. Reduced from a high-poly model using 3DS Max and entirely remade and additional reduction and details by me. Includes some parts from the high-poly model. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment.',NULL,'volkswagen','2010','polo',4.473931074142459607,2.183908104896549852,1.849388360977169964,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/508d4a1efd22f70b59fdb5e89c581117/2010-Volkswagen-Polo-TSI-Comfortline-MK5-5Door-6R-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(45,'816d1b7009d90c4a2a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','(Work in Progress) 2001 Seat Arosa','The Arosa replaced the SEAT Marbella in the Spanish brand''s lineup, but was not itself replaced by any SEAT model when production ceased in 2005. Apart from its exterior restyling the facelift model featured a restyled interior with a new dashboard. Not stolen. Please rate! #arosa #auto #car #city #pequeno #seat #urbano #vw #xrw960h',NULL,'seat','2001','arosa',4.167255640029909892,2.183907985687259857,1.692691683769230072,'yellow',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/816d1b7009d90c4a2a9eb0f146e94477/Work-in-Progress-2001-Seat-Arosa',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(46,'1134ed1bb5786e4e2a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1993 Mitsubishi Galant','A new Galant debuted in 1992 (model year 1994 in America), available as a four-door sedan and five-door liftback (sedan only in America). A Japan-only hardtop derivative called the (Japanese: Emeraude) (French for emerald) was also launched in 1992. This generation marked a substantial change in suspension design. The front switched from struts to a multi-link structure featuring two lower arms and one upper arm. The rear switched from a beam axle to a newly designed multi-link system. Both designs would carry over to the second generation Mitsubishi Eclipse and its sister vehicles. I found this on one of my old flash drives. Please rate! NOTE: a little similar to ZXT''s. #7th #auto #car #emeraude #liftback #midsize #mitsubishi #MMC #saloon #sedan #xrw960h',NULL,'mitsubishi','1993','galant',4.989009857177729935,2.028195142745969904,1.474510550498959959,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/1134ed1bb5786e4e2a9eb0f146e94477/1993-Mitsubishi-Galant',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(47,'65d33fe5184d015b94db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1995 Ferrari 456 GT Venice (Low Poly)','The Ferrari 456 is a front-engined grand tourer produced by Ferrari between 1992 to 2002. A 4-door wagon (estate) called the Ferrari 456 GT Venice was built in 1995. Only a small handful were made by Pininfarina. Prince Jefri Bolkiah of Brunei ordered seven to be built. After Pininfarina designed and built them, the prince only purchased six. Each wagon is rumored to have cost the Sultan around 1.5 million U.S. dollars. The name 456 is derived from the fact that each cylinder displaces 456 cubic centimeters. This was the last Ferrari to use this naming convention. It is essentially a detuned version of the engine that appears in the 550 and 575. Despite its supercar performance, the 456 has a relatively unstressed engine, which has proven to be a very reliable unit. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. I improved it almost entirely. Please rate! #456 #auto #automobile #brunei #car #coup #fast #ferrari #grand #gt #italian #pininfarina #rare #sedan #sport','matte glass','ferrari','1995','456',4.231191158294680399,1.786134123802189943,1.236048296093940068,'red',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(48,'2fcec17ab09a42782a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2006 Dodge Brisa','The Dodge Brisa was a series of two cars produced for the Venezuelan market. When the first generation model sold poorly, the second generation was introduced in 2006. This new Brisa was based on the Hyundai Getz. With the modern design, it mainly appealed to the young clientele. It was powered by a 4-cylinder gasoline engine with a displacement of approximately 1.3 L and a power of 81.5 hp. The curb weight was at 992 kg. As of summer 2009, the Dodge Brisa has been discontinued without an successor. Original by lone_wolf29. Please rate! #auto #brisa #car #dodge #getz #hyundai #popular #small #subcompact #xrw960h',NULL,'dodge','2006','brisa',4.245512008666990412,2.183907985687259857,1.693441987037660023,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/2fcec17ab09a42782a9eb0f146e94477/2006-Dodge-Brisa',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(49,'b76ec24b6b719910be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Aston Martin Cygnet','The Aston Martin Cygnet is a microcar produced by Aston Martin. The Aston Martin Cygnet is a 3-door hatchback marketed by Aston Martin beginning with model year 2011 as a rebadged variant of the Toyota iQ. The Cygnet enables Aston Martin to comply with the European Union-imposed fleet average emissions regulations taking effect in 2012. The Cygnet will be available initially only in the UK, and then to other EU countries. Production and sales commenced in January 2011 and the market coverage will expand by 2012. Sales will not be restricted; however, it is expected that demand from existing Aston Martin owners for Cygnet would initially take priority. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! #aston #auto #automobile #british #car #cygnet #iq #martin #microcar #small #tiny #toyota #xrw960h',NULL,'aston martin','2011','cygnet',3.372419476509089797,2.183908224105830076,1.599373579025270108,'orange',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/b76ec24b6b719910be40bb45ea25a041/2011-Aston-Martin-Cygnet',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(50,'1a744b320e069b5af63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2004 Jaguar X-Type Sedan','The Jaguar X-Type is a compact excecutive car that was sold from 2001 to 2009. The smallest of the Jaguar model range, the X-Type was marketed in saloon and wagon variants and was the only estate ever manufactured in series production by the company. The X-Type was manufactured at the Halewood Assembly Facility near Liverpool, a Jaguar Land Rover plant which also produces the Land Rover Freelander. Had it stored on my hard drive for some long time. Please rate! #auto #car #england #facelift #jaguar #sedan #wagon #xtype #xrw960h',NULL,'jaguar','2004','x-type',4.276383399963379794,2.037498116493229983,1.377614855766299939,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/1a744b320e069b5af63ee8a34069b7c5/2004-Jaguar-XType-Sedan',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(51,'c952c20acb638b85f63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1987 Mitsubishi Mirage/Lancer','The Mitsubishi Mirage/Lancer is a subcompact car made by Mitsubishi Motors. The 1987 third-generation Mirage was stylistically distinct: Mitsubishi had scored well with its revamped Galant and transferred its styling to the smaller cars. The basic model was a three-door with an upright tailgate. The top Mirages in Japan were called the Mirage Cyborg, featuring a turbocharged 1600 cc engine developing 145 PS (107 kW). I found it on the internet. Also, i did forgotten this from a long time ago. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #colt #compact #coupe #dodge #hatchback #lancer #mirage #mitsubishi #plymouth #sedan #small #xrw960h','matte glass','mitsubishi','1987','mirage',3.653167247772219905,1.609370350837709963,1.153158262372020015,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/c952c20acb638b85f63ee8a34069b7c5/1987-Mitsubishi-MirageLancer',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(52,'2655a48c8867146bf63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2007 Scion xD','The Scion xD is a five-door hatchback subcompact marketed in the US and Canada by Japanese manufacturer Toyota beginning with the 2008 model year, replacing the xA. The Scion xD and the second generation xB were first shown to the public on February 8, 2007 at the Chicago Auto Show. The xD appeared in Scion showrooms in mid 2007 and will be dropped after 2012. The xD comes standard with power locks, mirrors, and windows, and 16 wheels. The vehicle also has ABS, cruise control, a tire pressure monitoring system, Vehicle Stability Control (VSC) with Traction Control (TRAC), dual stage driver and passenger airbags, seat mounted driver and passenger side airbags, and side curtain airbags as standard features. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Please rate! #american #auto #automobile #car #cruiser #funky #hatchback #ist #japan #scion #toyota #urban #xd #xrw960h',NULL,'scion','2007','xd',4.10698413848877042,2.049587011337279829,1.703096525743599931,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/2655a48c8867146bf63ee8a34069b7c5/2007-Scion-xD',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(53,'d00fd6c674dbaf6059fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1989 Nissan Skyline HCR32 GTS-t Sedan (Low Poly)','The Nissan Skyline is a line of compact cars, sports cars and compact executive cars made by Nissan. The R32 Skyline debuted in May 1989. It was available as either a 2-door coupe or 4-door hardtop sedan, all other bodystyles were dropped. The R32 featured several versions of the RB-series straight-6 engines, which had improved heads (the twelve port inlet was gone) and used the ECCS (Electronically Concentrated Control System) injection system. Also available was an 1,800 cc 4-cylinder GXi model. Most models had HICAS four-wheel steering, with the rear wheels being hydraulically linked to the front steering. The 2.5-litre GTS-25 became one of the first Japanese production cars to feature a 5-speed automatic transmission. The GTS-t came in standard and Type M configurations, with the Type M having larger five-stud 16-inch wheels, four piston front callipers and twin piston rears plus other minor differences. ABS was optional (except for the GT-R and GTS-4), mechanical LSD was standard on the GTR and viscous LSD was standard on all turbo models and optional on all but the GXi. Nissan also produced 100 Australian models of the R32. There was also a 4WD version of the GTS-t Type M, called the GTS-4. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Deleted unnecessary content to reduce the file size. Please rate!','matte glass','nissan','1989','skyline',3.792167663574220083,1.624554991722110042,1.094180122250689946,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/d00fd6c674dbaf6059fdb5e89c581117/1989-Nissan-Skyline-HCR32-GTSt-Sedan-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(54,'70a69edcbf9a9bbd2a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','(Work in Progress) Alfa Romeo 8C Competizione','The Alfa Romeo 8C Competizione is a sports car produced by Italian automaker Alfa Romeo. It was first presented as a concept car at the 2003 Frankfurt Motor Show and later released for sale for the 2007 model year. The name refers to the eight cylinder (Cilindro in Italian) engine (8C) and Alfa Romeo''s racing pedigree (Competizione, Italian for ''Competition''). --A friend of mine sent me this via e-mail.-- Please rate! #8C #alfa #auto #car #competizione #coupe #detailed #exotic #ferrari #maserati #romeo #spider #sports #unfinished #wip #xrw960h',NULL,'alfa romeo',NULL,'8c',4.48192262649536044,2.183907985687259857,1.38924193382263006,'white',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(55,'77acca9231f0cf6894db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1994 Maserati Quattroporte IV','The Maserati Quattroporte IV is a mid-size sports sedan made by Maserati between 1994 to 2001. The Quattroporte IV from 1994 was a restyled and updated version of the 430, the four-door version of the Biturbo coupe. It was designed by Marcello Gandini, also known for penning the Lamborghini Countach, Urraco, Espada, Miura, Lancia Stratos, and Bugatti EB110. The new car was smaller, very aerodynamic (0.31 cd), and featured Gandini''s trademark angular rear wheel arch. A 2.8 L twin turbo V6 was installed, producing 284 PS (209 kW), reaching a top speed of 255 km/h (158 mph) while the Italians even had a tax special 2 litre version producing 287 PS (211 kW) on their price list. Both engines came from the familiar Maserati Biturbo engine catalog. The 2.8 was not even offered in the home market until a year after its introduction.[10] A V8 3.2 L Biturbo was announced in 1995, coming from the Maserati Shamal, developing 335 PS (246 kW) and reaching an approximate 270 km/h (168 mph). I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. I improved it almost entirely. Please rate! @Cloverleaf: Follow the link i posted.',NULL,'maserati','1994','quattroporte',3.753095388412480026,1.656710386276250003,1.169273187872019948,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/77acca9231f0cf6894db926ad0cd7381/1994-Maserati-Quattroporte-IV',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(56,'fd38328a7c90cb6459fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Lexus GS 350 (L10)','The Lexus GS is a mid-size sedan made by Toyota and sold under the Lexus division. The fourth generation GS had its world premiere at the Pebble Beach Concours d''Elegance in California in August 2011. The vehicle was shown to have a more subtle version of the LF-Gh''s spindle grille, while overall exterior dimensions are almost identical to the previous generation. L-shaped LED front daytime running lamps and rear LED tube lamps are a new design feature. The new GS was the centerpiece of Toyota Chairman Akio Toyoda''s initiative to restore passion to the Lexus brand and better compete with German luxury automakers that had been gaining market share in the United States. It was reported that Toyoda initially opposed the styling choices made for the new model, but since thanked the design team that persuaded him to greenlight the project. Imported by myself from Forza Horizon, using Forza Studio 4.1 and ZModeler 2. It has a racing kit, hidden as an extra. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment. #auto #automobile #car #grille #gs350 #japanese',NULL,'lexus','2010','gs',5.05747413635253995,2.183907985687259857,1.51212501525878995,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/fd38328a7c90cb6459fdb5e89c581117/2013-Lexus-GS-350-L10',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(57,'b47070a91102db1abe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1999 Seat Toledo (Typ 1M)','The Seat Toledo is a small family car produced by SEAT S.A.. The second generation Toledo (Typ 1M) was introduced in 1998 and made its dbut at the 1998 Paris Motor Show as a four-door notchback sedan. It was more rounded than the previous first generation shape and had a much more fluid design, although both were products of Giorgetto Giugiaro''s Italdesign studio with the latest generation being influenced by SEAT''s chief of exterior design Steve Lewis. It shared components with both its Volkswagen and koda PQ34 platform-mates - the Volkswagen Bora and the koda Octavia - yet is the sportiest of the three. In the interior, the dashboard was derived from that of the first-generation Audi A3.[8] Sport details have been added, such as completely translucent headlights not often seen in cars at that time and a dash panel with white dials. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #espaa #family #martorell',NULL,'seat','1999','toledo',4.989156007766720081,2.183908224105830076,1.624122023582460051,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/b47070a91102db1abe40bb45ea25a041/1999-Seat-Toledo-Typ-1M',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(58,'2f4255d6f0d2ff0661fd70b32ff741f','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1995 Chrysler/Dodge Neon Coup (Low Poly)','The Chrysler/Dodge Neon was a compact car made by Chrysler. The first generation Neon was introduced in January 1994 and manufactured until August 1999. It was available as a four-door sedan and a two-door coupe. Available engines were SOHC and DOHC versions of Chrysler''s 2.0 L 4-cylinder engine producing 132 hp (98 kW) at 6000 rpm and 129 lbft (175 Nm) at 5000 rpm or 150 hp (110 kW) at 6500 rpm and 133 lbft (180 Nm) at 5600 rpm, respectively; transaxle options were a 3-speed Torqueflite automatic or a five-speed manual. The car was badged and sold as both a Dodge and a Plymouth in the United States and Canada; in Mexico, Europe, Australia and other export markets it was sold as the Chrysler Neon. The Neon received praise for its appearance, price, and power when compared to competing cars such as the Honda Civic DX at 102 hp (76 kW), the Civic EX at 127 hp (95 kW), the Nissan Sentra at 115 hp (86 kW), the Ford Escort ZX2 at 130 hp (97 kW), the Toyota Corolla at 115 hp (86 kW), and the Chevrolet Cavalier Base and LS models at 120 hp (89 kW), among others. I imported this from a NFS Underground file originally ripped by AirOne Racing. It is painted in it''s original Nitro Yellow Green color (Color Code PF2). Please rate!','matte glass',NULL,'1995',NULL,4.495465755462650037,1.913878083229060057,1.423976525664329973,'green',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/2f4255d6f0d2ff0661fd70b32ff741f/1995-ChryslerDodge-Neon-Coup-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(59,'c8699dcbf2a4c2cbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2002 Toyota WiLL Cypha','The Toyota WiLL is a series of differently designed cars produced by Toyota between 2000 and 2005 being the Cypha the last one. The WiLL Cypha was produced from 2002 to 2005. It shared many of its mechanicals, including the 1.3-litre 2NZ and 1.5-litre 1NZ engines, with the Ist. Its styling developed themes seen in the Vitz/Yaris, but has a more angular look. Notable features are the rear lights placed level with the rear window, giving a look of the Renault Megane II, and the distinctive headlights which have four lamps per side arranged vertically. The interior used a rounded theme, with items such as the door pulls and the central console being circular. All Toyota WiLL Cyphas were manufactured by Central Motors at its Headquarter plant. In my opinion, this is a funky-looking car, but got ruined by it''s ugly front. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #cypha #funky #funny #ist #japanese #subcompact #toyota',NULL,'toyota','2002','will',4.285363674163820135,2.183908104896549852,1.891767621040340019,'orange',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/c8699dcbf2a4c2cbe40bb45ea25a041/2002-Toyota-WiLL-Cypha',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(60,'7adbe04d090bfa3ef63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2002 BMW E85 Z4 Roadster (With roof)','The BMW Z4 is a sports car produced by BMW. The first-generation BMW Z4 was designated the E85 in roadster form and E86 in coup form. It was designed by Danish BMW-designer Anders Warming. From 2003 the Z4 Roadster is available as a 3.0i (3.0 L I6 with 231 hp), a 3.0si available with the new generation 3.0 L I6 with 265 hp (198 kW), a 2.5si with a 2.5 I6 with 218 bhp (163 kW; 221 PS), a 2.2i with a straight-6 170 bhp (127 kW; 172 PS) engine, or a 2.0i with a 150 bhp (112 kW; 152 PS) 2.0 L I4. The Z4 coup is available only in the high-performance 3.0si trim powered by the 3.0 L 255 hp (190 kW) I6. The Z4 (E85 Roadster/E86 Coupe) was built at the Greer plant. I found it at the same time as the Outlander; changed the color, cleaned it and grouped every part. Please rate! #auto #bmw #car #coupe #germany #land #roadster #shark #sports #xrw960h #z4',NULL,'bmw','2002','z4',4.783677339553830343,2.183907985687259857,1.528872966766360086,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/7adbe04d090bfa3ef63ee8a34069b7c5/2002-BMW-E85-Z4-Roadster-With-roof',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(61,'c5fcea25cf3c62af59fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Lexus GS 350 F Sport (L10)','The Lexus GS is a mid-size sedan made by Toyota and sold under the Lexus division. The fourth generation GS had its world premiere at the Pebble Beach Concours d''Elegance in California in August 2011. The vehicle was shown to have a more subtle version of the LF-Gh''s spindle grille, while overall exterior dimensions are almost identical to the previous generation. L-shaped LED front daytime running lamps and rear LED tube lamps are a new design feature. The new GS was the centerpiece of Toyota Chairman Akio Toyoda''s initiative to restore passion to the Lexus brand and better compete with German luxury automakers that had been gaining market share in the United States. It was reported that Toyoda initially opposed the styling choices made for the new model, but since thanked the design team that persuaded him to greenlight the project. The GS 350 F Sport adds a rear-wheel steering system for improved handling. Imported by myself from Forza Horizon, using Forza Studio 4.1 and ZModeler 2. It has a racing kit, hidden as an extra. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment.',NULL,'lexus','2013','gs',5.05747413635253995,2.183907985687259857,1.51212501525878995,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/c5fcea25cf3c62af59fdb5e89c581117/2013-Lexus-GS-350-F-Sport-L10',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(62,'4a3eadef36256c6f661fd70b32ff741f','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Ferrari FF (With optional sunroof)','The Ferrari FF is a shooting-brake made by Ferrari. It is Ferrari''s first production four-wheel drive model. It replaced the 612 Scaglietti grand tourer. The FF has a top speed of 335 km/h (208 mph) and it accelerates from zero to 100 km/h (62 mph) in 3.7 seconds. Ferrari states that the FF is the world''s fastest four-seat automobile. The FF costs US$300,000, with 800 being produced during the first year. One was purchased by the Dubai police for use as a patrol vehicle near Burj Khalifa. The FF shares the design language of contemporary Ferraris, including the pulled-back headlights of the 458 Italia, and the twin circular taillights seen on the 458 as well as the 599 GTB Fiorano. Designed under the direction of Lowie Vermeersch, former Design Director at Pininfarina, work on the shooting brake concept initially started following the creation of the Sintesi show car of 2007. Distinctive styling elements include a large egg-crate grille, defined side skirts, and four exhaust tips. The shooting brake configuration is a departure from the conventional wedge shape of modern Ferraris, and the FF has been likened to the similarly-shaped 1962 Ferrari 250 GT SWB Breadvan race car. This is my low poly FF, but i added the optional panoramic glass sunroof and changed the paint. Please rate!','triangles','ferrari','2012','ff',4.704590797424319958,1.971332669258119897,1.380452112294729972,'gray',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(63,'7da7ba42dbd0a0f9be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Audi D4 A8','The Audi A8 is a full-size sedan made by Audi AG. The third-generation Audi A8 (Typ 4H) was introduced in Miami on 30 November 2009. It is based on the Volkswagen Group MLB platform, but retains the Audi Space Frame aluminium construction of the previous A8, making it the lightest all-wheel drive car in the full-size luxury segment, while also giving it best-in-class fuel economy. The quattro all-wheel drive system splits torque with a default bias of 40 percent front and 60 percent rear. The D4 A8 features all light-emitting diode (LED) headlights, an enhanced Multi Media Interface with touchpad, and an optional 1,400 watt Bang & Olufsen sound system. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. It''s original filesize was 20 MB. It hasn''t interior or engine. Please rate! #a8 #allnew #audi #auto #automobile #car #fullsize #headlights #large #led #limousine #renovated #sedan #xrw960h','matte glass','audi','2010','a8',4.039786815643309658,1.649003386497500001,1.181118667125699905,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/7da7ba42dbd0a0f9be40bb45ea25a041/2010-Audi-D4-A8',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(64,'67ce7c414fef414be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Mazda Carol (HB25)','The Mazda Carol is a kei-car made by Mazda from 1962 to present. For 2010, Mazda has launched a new Carol, which was first revealed at the 2009 Tokyo Motor Show. The Carol has been updated alongside its sister, the Suzuki Alto. However, the only changes between the Alto and the Carol are the logos and front bumper including Mazda''s corporate grille. It uses the same 658cc 3-cylinder engine from the Alto. It is available in 4WD and FWD variants. This was the Suzuki Alto i uploaded, but i added the Carol''s front bumper and the Mazda logos. Please rate! @AirbusA330: Yes, but it had a hiatus between 1970 and 1989. Btw Did you know that the Chevrolet Suburban is produced since 1935? @Ferrari: Do you remember my first sedan template? Well, i''m making a Lexus GS from it. #alto #auto #automobile #car #carol #compact #japanese #keicar #mazda #small #suzuki #xrw960h',NULL,'mazda','2011','carol',4.167751789093020242,2.183908104896549852,1.876585841178890046,'blue',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(65,'a859adca0620032bbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1985 Honda Today G','The Honda Today was a kei-car produced by Honda Motor Company between 1985 and 1998. The first generation Today was introduced in September 1985 as a three-door hatchback, on a wheelbase of 2,330 mm (91.7 in). The Today was initially launched with three different model specifications, with the entry model being model ''F'', followed by a model ''M'' and the top of the range ''G''. The Today was only intended for the Japanese domestic market. It was introduced at newly established Japanese dealerships called Honda Primo locations alongside the Primo headliner sedan, the Honda Civic. The flat roof hatchback design appearance was shared with the incrementally larger supermini Honda City, the subcompact Honda Civic, and the compact Honda Accord AeroDeck. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #hatchback #honda #japanese #keicar #small #today #xrw960h',NULL,'honda','1985','today',3.945416688919070048,2.183907866477969862,1.601020097732539948,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a859adca0620032bbe40bb45ea25a041/1985-Honda-Today-G',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(66,'ed8ba1d706f26c959fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Mercedes-Benz W221 S 65 AMG','The Mercedes-Benz S 65 AMG is a full-size luxury sports sedan made by Mercedes-Benz. The S 65 AMG includes Mercedes-Benz M275 V12 engine rated 612 PS (450 kW; 604 hp) and 1,000 Nm (738 lbfft), restyled front and rear bumpers and rocker panels, larger wheels, brakes, and tires, four exhaust pipes, modified and reprogrammed suspension for sport biased handling, and various interior changes. Apart from the higher output engine, many of the AMG modifications give the S65 AMG a distinctly different character than the S600 base V12 model. Imported by myself from Forza Horizon, using Forza Studio 4.1 and ZModeler 2. It has a racing kit, hidden as an extra. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment. #amg #auto #automobile #benz #car #european #executive #fullsize #german #luxury #mercedes #sclass #sklasse #s65 #sedan #sports #w221 #xrw960h',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5.383345127105710226,2.183907985687259857,1.558158516883850097,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/ed8ba1d706f26c959fdb5e89c581117/2012-MercedesBenz-W221-S-65-AMG',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(67,'2a3e09f729180b64be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1995 Ford Windstar/ Mercury Villager/ Nissan Quest','The Ford Windstar was a large minivan made by Ford Motor Company. The Windstar was released in March 1994 as a 1995 model. Its sleek design, front-wheel drive layout, and better car-like handling made it more competitive with similar offerings from Chrysler and GM. The Windstar had beaten the third-generation Chrysler minivans to the market by over a year, which played a crucial role in Ford taking significant market share in the minivan market. I found it on the internet some months ago, i cleaned it and coloured it. Please rate! @Endominium: When i got the base 3ds model, it said windstar, but you are right, this is the Quest or the Villager. As i''m not completely sure, i did put the name of the three on the title. #auto #automobile #car #family #ford #large #minivan #windstar #xrw960h','matte glass',NULL,'1995',NULL,4.647270679473879618,2.100727796554569871,1.68562316987663996,'green',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/2a3e09f729180b64be40bb45ea25a041/1995-Ford-Windstar-Mercury-Villager-Nissan-Quest',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(68,'bd1347003799b262be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1967 Honda N360','The Honda N360 is a kei-car produced by Honda Motor Company. The car featured front wheel drive and an air-cooled, four stroke, 354 cc, 31 hp (23 kW) two-cylinder engine, and was borrowed from the Honda CB450 motorcycle. The displacement was reduced so as to comply with kei car legislation which stipulated maximum allowable engine displacement. This same engine was also used in the Honda Vamos, with a beam axle/leaf spring rear suspension. The N prefix stands for the Japanese word norimono which means vehicle in English. The exterior dimensions were in compliance with Japanese government regulations concerning kei cars, however, vehicles installed with the 402 cc and 599 cc engines were too large for the category, and were largely intended for international sales. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Fully detailed. Please rate! @Ferrari: Nope. It replaced the Hustler. And i have a GTA SA CD-ROM but doesn''t work, when i get it to work, i already have some ready mods! #360 #600',NULL,'honda','1967','n360',3.15683507919312012,1.294009327888490101,1.313356227241460061,'blue',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(69,'9765cfe1085d0d7e661fd70b32ff741f','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Ferrari FF (Low Poly)','The Ferrari FF is a shooting-brake made by Ferrari. It is Ferrari''s first production four-wheel drive model. It replaced the 612 Scaglietti grand tourer. The FF has a top speed of 335 km/h (208 mph) and it accelerates from zero to 100 km/h (62 mph) in 3.7 seconds. Ferrari states that the FF is the world''s fastest four-seat automobile. The FF costs US$300,000, with 800 being produced during the first year. One was purchased by the Dubai police for use as a patrol vehicle near Burj Khalifa. The FF shares the design language of contemporary Ferraris, including the pulled-back headlights of the 458 Italia, and the twin circular taillights seen on the 458 as well as the 599 GTB Fiorano. Designed under the direction of Lowie Vermeersch, former Design Director at Pininfarina, work on the shooting brake concept initially started following the creation of the Sintesi show car of 2007. Distinctive styling elements include a large egg-crate grille, defined side skirts, and four exhaust tips. The shooting brake configuration is a departure from the conventional wedge shape of modern Ferraris, and the FF has been likened to the similarly-shaped 1962 Ferrari 250 GT SWB Breadvan race car. I made this from a reduced Ferrari FF that i originally imported from Forza 4, using my polygon reduction technique, and it has parts from the original model. I''ll make more models using this technique. It may not look too low-poly. Please rate!','triangles','ferrari','2012','ff',3.82305884361267001,1.601950287818910023,1.121787067502739932,'yellow',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(70,'6f7a6fb3ca548e9959fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 BMW E89 Z4 sDrive28i','The BMW Z4 is a rear-wheel drive sports car made by BMW. The second generation Z4 was officially announced on 13 December 2008 and was later unveiled at the 2009 North American International Auto Show in Detroit. The second generation Z4 is now a coup-convertible with folding hardtop. It moved upmarket, dropping the small four-cylinder base engine. In late 2011 BMW reintroduced a 2.0 litre, 4-cylinder powerplant with twin-scroll turbo (N20 engine variant). Since the new Z4 now has a retractable hardtop, it no longer comes in separate roadster and coup versions. The two-piece, electro-hydraulic retractable hardtop in lightweight aluminium shell can be folded up or down in 20 seconds automatically. In the open state, the boot capacity is 180 liters (if closed: 310 l). Imported by myself from Forza Horizon, using Forza Studio 4.1 and ZModeler 2. It has a racing kit, hidden as an extra. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment. @Bmwfan101: Sure you can, but tell me in the ratings if someone accidentally adds it to the stolen cars collection. (Update as of 07/09/2013: Added retractable hardtop roof as another extra.)',NULL,'bmw','2012','z4',4.802254199981690341,2.183907985687259857,1.488317608833310102,'yellow',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/6f7a6fb3ca548e9959fdb5e89c581117/2012-BMW-E89-Z4-sDrive28i',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(71,'c4b621690b8d6fca59fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Ferrari 458 Italia Spider','The Ferrari 458 Italia Spider is a mid-engined sports car made by Ferrari. The 458 Italia replaces the Ferrari F430. The 458 Italia was officially unveiled at the 2009 Frankfurt Motor Show on 15 September 2009. Ferrari unveiled the 458 Spider at the 2011 Frankfurt Motor Show. This convertible variant of the 458 Italia features an aluminium retractable hardtop which, according to Ferrari, weighs 25 kilograms (55 lb) less than a soft roof such as the one found on the Ferrari F430 Spider, and can be retracted in 14 seconds. The engine cover has been redesigned to cope with the retractable roof system. Ferrari plans to make 1,500-2,000 458 Spiders every year. It has the same 0-100 km/h time as the hard-top but has a lower top speed 198 mph (319 km/h). Imported by myself from Forza Horizon, using Forza Studio 4.1 and ZModeler 2. It has a racing kit, hidden as an extra. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment. #458 #auto #automobile #car #convertible #enzo #ferrari #grand #italia #italian #maranello #spider #sports #supercar #tourer #xrw960h',NULL,'ferrari','2013','458 italia spider',4.367638111114500176,2.183907985687259857,1.139825463294980023,'red',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(72,'4f042d0c9c0b796f94db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2000 Mitsubishi Lancer ES/Lancer Cedia (Low Poly)','the Mitsubishi Lancer is a compact car made by Mitsubishi since 1973. The year 2000 saw the release of the Lancer Cedia in Japan (meaning Century Diamond); though in most markets the previous 1995 vintage Mirage-based Lancer continued on, built at Mitsubishi''s Mizushima plant in Japan. The new model was available in sedan and station wagon forms. In Europe, the Lancer was not offered in some countries, being too close to the size of the Dutch-built Carisma, so the Evo VII model sold there bore the Carisma name. This series of Lancer is still sold in Japan where the 2007 onwards generation Lancer is known as Galant Fortis. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. It hasn''t interior. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #cedia #compact #es #family #fortis #japanese #lancer #mitsubishi #small #xrw960h','matte glass','mitsubishi','2000','lancer',3.993241071701049805,1.735537171363829901,1.488963639130820083,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/4f042d0c9c0b796f94db926ad0cd7381/2000-Mitsubishi-Lancer-ESLancer-Cedia-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(73,'ef3174b2819c08edf63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Great Wall Voleex C10/i7/Phenom','The Great Wall Voleex C10 or i7 is a subcompact car made by Great Wall Motor of China. Known also as the Great Wall Phenom, the C10 features a distinctive front grille design but shares many visual similarities with the Toyota Yaris/Vitz. A more restrained grille is available in some markets. The C20R is an offroad-looking version of the C10. I personally think that this is one of the best looking chinese cars. This is the better one, because i didn''t want to do the one with the huge grille, and thus, this one was easier to make. Original by lone_wolf29 and me. Please rate! #auto #c10 #car #china #great #i7 #motor #phenom #subcompact #supermini #toyota #vitz #voleex #wall #xrw960h #yaris',NULL,NULL,'2010',NULL,3.606132268905640092,1.879005193710330036,1.429677297361199972,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/ef3174b2819c08edf63ee8a34069b7c5/2010-Great-Wall-Voleex-C10i7Phenom',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(74,'352bd4e50c97caa19aa387dd568006ae','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2009 Honda Accord Coup (8th Gen.)','The 8th Gen. Honda Accord is a mid-size coup, full-size sedan and fastback (Crosstour) produced by Honda. The Honda Accord Coupe was previewed by the concept of the same name at the 2007 North American International Auto Show. It previewed the production 2-door model with i-VTEC VCM V6 engine and Advanced Compatibility Engineering body structure. Engines include at 2.4 Liter 4-cylinder rated at 177 bhp (132 kW) with 161 lbft (218 Nm) for Lx-Se sedans and 190 bhp (142 kW) with 162 lbft (220 Nm) for EX-Ex-l sedans and coupes; as well as a 3.5 Liter V6 rated at 272 bhp (203 kW) and 254 lbft (344 Nm). I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. I added many details, like the amber lines on the headlights, the tailights and the ''Accord'' logo. Please rate! #accord #auto #automobile #car #coupe #crosstour #fullsize #honda #inspire #large #midsize #sedan #xrw960h',NULL,'honda','2009','accord',4.09503173828125,1.833214163780209959,1.23982967808842992,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/352bd4e50c97caa19aa387dd568006ae/2009-Honda-Accord-Coup-8th-Gen',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(75,'3220cc9f67cd763af63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Ford Ka (Brazilian)','The Ford Ka is a city car (in Brazil now it''s a supermini) made by Ford Motor Company. Ford presented the new Brazilian Ka on 14 December 2007. Sales started on January 2, 2008 in Brazil, and the car was exported to other markets in Latin America. In comparison to the original Ka this car has a longer rear overhang and a redesigned rear seat to accommodate a fifth passenger. With a length of 3835 mm, it now fits in the subcompact car class. In 2011 Ford presented a facelifted version following the Kinect concept car. In Brazil, only the Sport version offers a 1.6-litre engine. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! #auto #automobile #brasil #car #ford #ka #larger #other #supermini #xrw960h',NULL,'ford','2008','ka',3.942699432373049983,1.95521104335785001,1.490959350019690043,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/3220cc9f67cd763af63ee8a34069b7c5/2008-Ford-Ka-Brazilian',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(76,'447bed55e7c4fec2f63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2003 Mitsubishi Outlander','The Mitsubishi Outlander is a crossover SUV made by Mitsubishi Motor Company. The Outlander arrived in 2003 in North America, replacing the Mitsubishi Montero Sport, with a modified front grille and headlights which increased the overall length by approximately 130 millimetres (5.1 in), and the two models were manufactured in parallel thereafter. It shared its platform with the Mitsubishi Grandis, also introduced in 2003. In several South American markets it was known as the Montero Outlander, to benefit from an association with the strong-selling Mitsubishi Montero Sport. In Venezuela, it was sold from 2004 to 2007. Had it stored on my hard drive from a long time ago, but i recoloured it, added the Outlander badge (made with freehand) and softened. Please rate! #airtrek #auto #automobile #car #compact #crossover #europe #japan #mitsubishi #montero #outlander #sport #SUV #utility #vehicle #xrw960h',NULL,'mitsubishi','2003','outlander',4.738835811614990235,2.183907985687259857,1.783364653587339977,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/447bed55e7c4fec2f63ee8a34069b7c5/2003-Mitsubishi-Outlander',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(77,'f70c80bfd94c9d35be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2005 Lexus GS430 (Low Poly)','The Lexus GS is a mid-size luxury car produced by Toyota under it''s Lexus division. Production of the third generation began on January 24, 2005, with an equivalent Toyota Aristo not released as Toyota had introduced the Lexus channel to Japan and sought to align all world markets using Lexus as their luxury brand worldwide. The third generation GS was the introductory Lexus model for the marque''s new L-finesse design philosophy, indicating the future direction of the Lexus lineup; it featured a fastback profile, retained quad headlights, LED tailamps, and one-piece bumpers. The drag coefficient on the third generation GS design reached 0.27 Cd, and the model used a newly designed midsize platform later shared with the second generation IS. All made by me from my Sedan Template. Took 3-5 hours to make. I used as references photos from the internet and my Matchbox 1:64 die-cast. It isn''t too accurate. The GS was never oficially exported to Venezuela, but i seen two in my entire life, both white. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #gs #gs430',NULL,'lexus','2005','gs',5.36420750617980957,2.183908104896549852,1.633740663528439941,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f70c80bfd94c9d35be40bb45ea25a041/2005-Lexus-GS430-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(78,'c399c56919a1abb0f63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1978 Mitsubishi Galant  Sigma','The third generation Mitsubishi Galant was a compact car manufactured by Mitsubishi Motor Corporation. The third-generation of the car was introduced in 1976, and was known as Galant  (Sigma). In many export markets the car was simply known as the Galant. At that time, the Dodge Colt in America was actually a Mitsubishi Lancer, not the Galant anymore, but nonetheless the Galant Wagon variant was sold with the Dodge Colt label in the US and Canada. In Australia, where the car was made locally at Chrysler''s Clovelly Park plant, it was known as the Chrysler Sigma and, after the buyout of Chrysler Australia by Mitsubishi, as the Mitsubishi Sigma. Australian content was quite high and included a locally-made 2.6-litre ''Astron'' four in place of the 1.6, 1.85 and two-litre engines used in other export markets. I imported this from a GTA: Vice City file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! #auto #car #chrysler #colt #compact #coupe #dodge #galant #mitsubishi #sapporo',NULL,'mitsubishi','1978','galant',4.96267843246459961,2.018733739852910158,1.550484895706180089,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/c399c56919a1abb0f63ee8a34069b7c5/1978-Mitsubishi-Galant-Sigma',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(79,'8f97f2367f75b23c59fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1999 Honda Civic Si Coup (Low Poly)','The Honda Civic is a compact car made by Honda. The Civic Si reappeared in 1998, available as a coup only. With the adoption of the VTi badge in Europe and the SiR and Type R badges in Japan for the sports variants of Civics, the Si became primarily a US-specific badge, a branding trend that would continue in subsequent Civic generations. Going from 0-60 in 7.9 seconds, the 1999 Civic Si trim featured a 1.6-litre B16A2 engine that made 160 hp (119 kW) at 8,000 rpm and 111 ft-lbs of torque at 7,000 rpm. While similar to the powerplant in the Del Sol VTEC, the Civic Si saw some notable differences, which include a larger throttle body, improved intake manifold, strengthened connecting rods, low-friction/high-silicon pistons, a fully counterweighted crankshaft, and an exhaust system with larger piping diameter. Due to its good fuel economy (27/31 city/hwy MPG), independent suspension at all four corners, and a more popular coupe form, the trim garnered a dedicated following in spite of its short production cycle. I imported this from a NFS Underground 2 file originally ripped by AirOne Racing. Please rate!',NULL,'honda','1999','civic',4.114591121673580432,1.715447187423710051,1.276371701387690071,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/8f97f2367f75b23c59fdb5e89c581117/1999-Honda-Civic-Si-Coup-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(80,'67de745257a2b6c059fdb5e89c581117','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 BMW F13 M6','The BMW M6 is an executive luxury sports coup made by BMW. The M6 is the high performance version of the 6-Series coup/convertible. The new model is based on the BMW F12/F13 and shares its 7-speed M-DCT gearbox, BMW S63 V8 engine and other technology with the BMW M5 (F10). The M6 coup has a carbon-fiber roof and other weight saving measures, making it 20 kg (44 lb) lighter than the M5, however it is 140 kg (309 lb) heavier than the previous M6. The M6 convertible is 50 kg (110 lb) heavier than the previous M6 Convertible. The official performance figures claim acceleration from 0100 km/h (062 mph) in 4.2 seconds and an electronically limited top speed of 250 km/h (155 mph) without the M Driver''s Package (allows it to run up to 300 km/h) . The design style is similar to all recent M cars. The front of the car has a newly designed M kidney grille with an M6 badge  a homage to the first generation M6. Imported by myself from Forza Horizon, using Forza Studio 4.1 and ZModeler 2. It has a racing kit, hidden as an extra. Hope you all like it, please rate and comment.',NULL,'bmw','2013','f13 m6',5.131088495254520154,2.183908104896549852,1.45457649230957009,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/67de745257a2b6c059fdb5e89c581117/2013-BMW-F13-M6',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(81,'730084fd337065a6be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Acura TSX Sedan','The Acura TSX is a entry-level luxury car produced by Honda under the Acura brand. The fully redesigned 2009 Acura TSX made its debut at the 2008 New York International Auto Show on April 11, 2008. In terms of size, the 2009 TSX is larger than its predecessor. The new TSX has a 3.0-inch (76 mm) greater width, a 2.6-inch (66 mm) wider track and a 1.3-inch (33 mm) longer wheelbase than the previous TSX; additionally, the length grew by 2.4 inches (61 mm). Curb weight also increased by approximately 100 to 150 pounds (45 to 68 kg). I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. It has it''s logos. Please rate! #accord #acura #american #auto #automobile #car #euro #experimental #honda #japanese #sportscar #sprior #touring #tsx #xrw960h',NULL,'acura','2010','tsx',4.676998615264889913,2.082869887351990191,1.425817131996149901,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/730084fd337065a6be40bb45ea25a041/2010-Acura-TSX-Sedan',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(82,'ab3273b474337ac094db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2004 Fiat Stilo 5-Door (Low Poly)','The Fiat Stilo is a small family car produced by Fiat from 2001 to 2007 in Europe, where in Brazil was produced from 2003 to 2010. The Stilo 3-door and 5-door were launched in 2001 to replace the Fiat Bravo/Brava, with the Stilo MultiWagon following in 2002. The all-new Fiat Bravo is the successor of the Stilo in most markets. The Stilo was the first car worldwide to use the TRW Column-Drive Electric Power-Assisted Steering (EPS) technology later introduced on the 2003 Nissan Micra & Renault Megane. I ripped this car from the game Crash Time III: Highway Nights, i edited it to look like the real life car, because the original car looked different. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #european #family #fiat #hatchback #italian #small #stilo #wagon #xrw960h','matte glass','fiat','2004','stilo',3.655239582061769798,1.695958137512209918,1.318863717839120043,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/ab3273b474337ac094db926ad0cd7381/2004-Fiat-Stilo-5Door-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(83,'e9ca155fd009ea7abe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Honda Stepwgn (Low Poly)','The Honda Stepwgn (Stepwagon) is a mid-size MPV produced by Honda Motor Company since 1996. The fourth generation Honda Stepwgn is a full redesign of the model, and was launched on October 9, 2009. The model grew in size, increasing in height and length, but remained the same width. The Stepwgn Spada model returned, keeping its unique grille and headlamp design, giving it an imposing, more upmarket and sporty look. The Stepwgn is available in seven trim levels: G, G L Package, L, Li, Spada S, Spada Z and Spada Zi. The 2.4 litre engine has been dropped from the lineup, with only a 2.0 litre petrol option currently available. The Stepwgn is available with either front- or four-wheel-drive across the range. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. I improved it. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #honda #japanese #midsize #minivan #mpv #stepwagon #stepwgn #xrw960h',NULL,'honda','2010','step wagon',4.999126911163330079,2.183908224105830076,1.961675047874450017,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/e9ca155fd009ea7abe40bb45ea25a041/2010-Honda-Stepwgn-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(84,'ea8dbed025fe31a0be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Suzuki Wagon R (Low Poly)','The Suzuki Wagon R is a kei-car produced by Suzuki. The fifth generation Wagon R range was launched in Japan in September 2012 and for the first time, this new model now comes with the a new mild-hybrid system named ENE-CHARGE (short for ''energy charge'') and an energy-saving electric air conditioning system dubbed ECO-COOL. With the R06A engine combined with an electric motor/generator and a lithium-ion battery, this new ENE-CHARGE provides regenerative braking and at least some level of power assist to the internal combustion engine while it can also run certain electrical equipment. Thanks to this technology, the new Wagon R can get up to 28.8km/l in Japan''s JC08 driving cycle (67.8mpg US, 3.5lt/100km or 81.4mpg UK). This was originally the 2008 model, but i edited it to look like the 2013 one. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #japanese #keicar #small #stingray #suzuki #wagon_r #xrw960h',NULL,'suzuki','2013','wagon r',4.24629783630371005,2.207428693771360084,2.081764698028560013,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/ea8dbed025fe31a0be40bb45ea25a041/2013-Suzuki-Wagon-R-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(85,'84b8dbd536d7451b94db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2007 Lexus LS460L','The Lexus LS is a full-size luxury sedan that serves as the flagship model of Lexus, the luxury division of Toyota. Development on fourth generation LS began in 2001, with the design process being done under Yo Hiruta from 2002 to 2004 when the final production design was selected. In October 2005, Lexus premiered a gasoline-electric hybrid concept car, the LF-Sh (Lexus Future-Sedan hybrid), at the Tokyo Motor Show, publicly previewing the next Lexus flagship with a concept version for the first time. Introduced at the January 2006 North American International Auto Show for the 2007 model year, the fourth-generation Lexus LS became the first Lexus model to be produced in both standard and long-wheelbase versions. Using an all-new platform, the LS 460 (USF40) uses the standard 2,969 mm (116.9 in) wheelbase, while the LS 460 L (USF41) features a stretched 3,091 mm (121.7 in) wheelbase. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. I improved it a lot, because many of the parts were too small scaled and everything was ungrouped. Please rate!','triangles','lexus','2007','ls',4.137353420257570136,1.713358044624329946,1.196481207385660107,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/84b8dbd536d7451b94db926ad0cd7381/2007-Lexus-LS460L',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(86,'926fcc3cd462c316661fd70b32ff741f','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Peugeot 308 3-Door (Low Poly)','The Peugeot 308 is a small family car made by Peugeot. It was unveiled on 5 June 2007 and launched in September 2007. Its development code was Project T7, and is the first car of the X08 generation of Peugeot models. The 308 features a range of petrol and diesel engine options. Launched as the replacement for the Peugeot 307 in most international markets, the new vehicle was based upon the old 307s chassis, but has new bodywork and is slightly longer and wider. Its coefficient of drag is 0.29, and it has a five-star Euro NCAP rating. I made this the same way as the Ferrari FF, but this time i converted the 308 GTi to a normal 2008 308. I edited it a lot to make it really low poly. Please rate! #308 #auto #automobile #csegment #car #coupe #family #french #hatchback #peugeot #rcz #small #station #wagon #xrw960h','triangles','peugeot','2008','308',3.643759965896609998,1.746550202369689941,1.519263166934250008,'blue',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(87,'d9b2fc71e809140bbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Nissan Qashqai/Dualis','The Nissan Qashqai is a compact crossover SUV produced by Nissan Motor Company. On 4 December 2009, Nissan announced the Qashqai''s next version, which went on sale in March 2010. The model''s front end has been completely restyled while the rear now includes LED tail-lights. Modifications to the interior include a new instrument panel layout for the vehicle''s drive computer, better soundproofing and minor storage additions. ESP is now standard across the range and two new exterior colours have been added. The launch of an eco-friendly Pure Drive variant has also been announced. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. It hasn''t interior or engine. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #crossover #dualis #facelift #midcycle #nissan #qashqai #renovated #stylish #suv #xrw960h','matte glass','nissan','2010',NULL,3.724035739898679864,1.823919773101809971,1.423905162140729929,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/d9b2fc71e809140bbe40bb45ea25a041/2010-Nissan-QashqaiDualis',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(88,'586da8cf648767222a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1987 Toyota Corolla (E90)','The Corolla E90 was the sixth generation of cars sold by Toyota under the Corolla nameplate.  The performance option of rear-wheel drive was dropped after 1986, with all Corollas front-wheel drive from 1987, with production beginning in May 1987. For general export, the trim levels are Base, XL, GL, SE, and SE Limited. The GT-i was sold in limited numbers in certain countries. The all wheel drive Sprinter Carib wagon used a solid axle rear suspension with coil springs, while the rest used struts all around. The 4WD wagon was sold from 1988 to 1994 and had different bodywork to other Corollas. It was called the All-Trac in the US and sold with the Tercel or Corolla name in some countries. In general, all models depart from the previous generation''s boxy styling, for a more contemporary look and improved aerodynamics. In Venezuela it was sold from 1990 to 1993. I found it on the internet. Please rate! #araya #auto #car #carib #cielo #corolla #geo #holden #levin #nova #prizm #sky #sprinter #subcompact #toyota',NULL,'toyota','1987','corolla',5.036034584045410157,2.183908104896549852,1.601945281028750002,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/586da8cf648767222a9eb0f146e94477/1987-Toyota-Corolla-E90',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(89,'4e6858285e29c0b7a658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Toyota 86/GT86 RC (Low Poly)','The Toyota GT 86 is a compact sports car developed by Toyota and Subaru. The GT 86 will be sold as the Toyota 86 in Japan, South Africa and Australia and Toyota GT86 in Europe, as the Subaru BRZ worldwide and as the Scion FR-S in the American market. The 86 refers to the Toyota Corolla Levin series AE86 and the Toyota Sprinter Trueno series AE86, a particular series of cars sold between 1983 and 1987 (both the Levin and Trueno were available in coupe and hatchback bodystyles). As such, the Toyota 86 has been named as the spiritual successor of the original AE86 during the press release of the 86. The RC version is the most cheaper version of the 86, having black plastic bumpers and door handles and with steel wheels. I 100% made this in Blender 2.49b, from a model i imported of it, using the Polygon Reducer add-on that it included. It has elements from the high poly version, like the wheels, mirrors and wheels. Please rate! #86 #ae86 #auto #automobile #brz #car #corolla #coupe #frs #gt86 #levin #racing #scion #sports #stylish #subaru #toyota','triangles','toyota','2013',NULL,3.371353149414059836,1.594496250152589889,1.159620715305210049,NULL,NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/4e6858285e29c0b7a658426ef34a90c8/2013-Toyota-86GT86-RC-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(90,'a2be8a4701e51785a658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2007 Mazda Furai Concept','The Mazda Furai is a concept car revealed on 27 December 2007 and manufactured by Mazda. A teaser image of the vehicle was released on 11 December 2007. The Furai officially debuted at the 2008 North American International Auto Show in Detroit. The Furai ( Frai?), meaning sound of the wind, is the fifth and last of the Mazda Nagare line of concept cars that have been made by Mazda since 2006. The chassis is based on the Courage Comptition C65 Le Mans Prototype that Mazda last used to compete in the American Le Mans Series, two seasons previously and is designed to use E100 ethanol fuel, it is powered by a new generation 20B 3-rotor wankel engine that puts out 450 brake horsepower (340 kW). The engine is developed and built by renowned rotary tuner, Racing Beat, who also built the car''s rotary-shaped muffler canister. The car bears the #55 number that of its 1991 24 Hours of Le Mans winning ancestor, the 787B. Unlike many concept cars, the Furai is fully functional and is currently being tested at various tracks. It has run at Laguna Seca and Buttonwillow. I found this in a Zmodeler file, and the model is ripped from Forza Motorsport 3. It doesnt have it''s decals; it''s literally a plain Furai. Please rate!',NULL,'mazda','2007','furai concept',3.781254053115839842,1.620514392852780094,0.8686577643966300056,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a2be8a4701e51785a658426ef34a90c8/2007-Mazda-Furai-Concept',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(91,'6b3ebc3773e7272cbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Vauxhall/Opel Agila/Suzuki Splash','The Vauxhall/Opel Agila is a city car made by Suzuki and Opel/Vauxhall. The second-generation Agila was officially announced on May 15, 2007, and was presented at the 2007 Frankfurt Motor Show. Suzuki marketed this generation under the Splash nameplate. The car is 200 mm (7.9 in) longer than its predecessor, similar to small superminis and mini MPVs such as the Citron C3 Picasso, Toyota Yaris, Honda Jazz and Nissan Micra. While many city cars such as the MINI and Toyota iQ come with just three doors, the Agila comes with five. It is/was tall as Korean city cars such as the Hyundai i10. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp. I reduced a lot the filesize and added some details. Please rate! #agila #auto #automobile #british #car #city #german #japanese #opel #small #splash #suzuki #vauhall #xrw960h',NULL,NULL,'2011',NULL,3.930009484291080212,2.046450138092040128,1.716963648796079988,'green',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/6b3ebc3773e7272cbe40bb45ea25a041/2011-VauxhallOpel-AgilaSuzuki-Splash',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(92,'3fb1bb6125233059be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Honda Civic Si Coup','The Honda Civic is a compact car manufactured by Honda Motor Company. In May 2010, the ninth-generation Civic was said to be delayed into 2011, because of changing market conditions and tougher fuel economy and emissions regulations. The Civic Si sedan and coupe models have a larger, more powerful 2.4-liter inline-four engine with 201 hp (149 kW) and 170 lb-ft (230 Nm) of torque, as well as a new 6-speed manual transmission. The Civic Si achieves an EPA-estimated highway fuel economy of 31 mpg-US (7.6 L/100 km; 37 mpg-imp), an increase of 2 mpg-US (2.4 mpg-imp). I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! @Bananas: We in Venezuela didn''t got none of the new generation, because Honda left the Venezuelan market in 2009 :( #automobile #civic #compact #coupe #honda #performance #si #sport #sporty #xrw960hcarauto',NULL,'honda','2012','civic',4.510962486267089844,2.017549514770510033,1.443671934539449974,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/3fb1bb6125233059be40bb45ea25a041/2012-Honda-Civic-Si-Coup',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(93,'a5d32daf96820ca5f63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2002 Citron C8','The Citron C8 is a Large MPV made by Citron. The C8, algong with the Peugeot 807, the Fiat Ulysse and the Lancia Phedra, was built at Sevel Nord factory, located in Lieu-Saint-Amand, France and all of them were also known as Eurovans. Citron chose to put the minivan in line with its new naming theme, where models were called Cx (x being a number roughly corresponding to the relative size of a given model), hence the Citron C8. The C8 has now been axed in Europe, and the function as Eurovan has been divided between the Citron Grand C4 Picasso and the new Citron DS5. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! @Nikonmorous: Well , i don''t know if with the free Sketchup can import 3DS files. But i have the Sketchup 8 Pro. #807 #auto #c8 #car #citroen #europe #eurovan #fiat #lancia #peugeot #phedra #sevel #ulysse #xrw960h','matte glass','citroen','2002','c8',3.766000032424929866,1.726904630661010077,1.577422130852939919,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a5d32daf96820ca5f63ee8a34069b7c5/2002-Citron-C8',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(94,'5973afc979049405f63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Honda Accord/Inspire Sedan (North America & Asia)','The Honda Accord or Inspire is a full-size sedan made by Honda Motor Company. The North American version of the Accord is the same vehicle as its Japanese counterpart. This shape is sold as the Honda Inspire in Japan, and is not sold in Europe. Larger than the previous model, the sedan is now classified as a full-size car by EPA standards. A coupe version is available, as well as a Crosstour fastback model, which was introduced in the US for the 2010 model year. Engines include at 2.4 Liter 4-cylinder rated at 177 bhp (132 kW) with 161 lbft (218 Nm) for Lx-Se sedans and 190 bhp (142 kW) with 162 lbft (220 Nm) for EX-Ex-l sedans and coupes; as well as a 3.5 Liter V6 rated at 272 bhp (203 kW) and 254 lbft (344 Nm). I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. Please rate! #accord #auto #automobile #car #coupe #crosstour #fullsize #honda #inspire #large #midsize #sedan #xrw960h',NULL,'honda','2011',NULL,5.004773616790769708,2.183908104896549852,1.512212872505189986,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/5973afc979049405f63ee8a34069b7c5/2011-Honda-AccordInspire-Sedan-North-America-Asia',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(95,'d126a4c016fa140bbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Scion tC/ Toyota Zelas','The Scion tC is a compact coup produced by Toyota under it''s Scion brand. The second generation of the tC debuted at the April 2010 New York Auto Show, and it was scheduled to appear in U.S. dealerships in October 2010. It was to be equipped with a 2.5 liter I4 2AR-FE engine producing 180 hp (130 kW) and 174 lbft (236 Nm), once again carried over from the Toyota Camry. Visually, the second generation is a toned-down variant of the Scion Fuse concept, featuring a similar rear quarter-panel window line and xB-style blacked-out A-pillars. However, taillights, headlights, and nose treatment are less radical. The 2011 tC continues to have an all-glass roof, roomy interior, and hatchback design. Other changes include a wider track, standard 18-inch (460 mm) wheels, larger brake discs, and a performance-tuned electric power steering system. It should also be noted that all measurements from the first generation to second generation are the same, with the exception of the width, which is increased from 69.1 to 70.7. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp. I reduced a lot the filesize and added some details. Please rate! @Ferrari: There are lots of mods!',NULL,NULL,'2012',NULL,4.643608808517459608,2.183908224105830076,1.503750920295719994,'white',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(96,'29976b64fe938129a658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Chevrolet Montana LS','The Chevrolet Montana is a subcompact coup utility produced by GM Brasil. In October of 2010, Chevrolet presented the second generation Montana, now based on the Chevrolet Agile. The Montana has some elements borrowed from the Agile, like the front styling. The entry-level trim, the Conquest was replaced by the LS, and the top-of-the-line trim is now the Sport. From now, Chevrolet currently only offers the 1.4 Econoflex engine, but it could receive new engines in the future. The previous generation was sold in Venezuela, but currently, this version isn''t offered. It is currently being sold at most Mercosur countries (like Argentina, Chile, etc.). I made this from my previously posted Montana Sport. Please rate! #agile #auto #automobile #brasil #brazilian #car #chevrolet #chevy #coupe #mercosur #montana #pickup #subcompact #utility #xrw960h','matte glass','chevrolet','2011','montana',4.842469215393069959,2.079869031906130151,1.677436472848059967,'white',NULL,'truck','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/29976b64fe938129a658426ef34a90c8/2011-Chevrolet-Montana-LS',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(97,'c79aad1f7ca0c936f63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Mazda 2/Demio 5-Door','The Mazda2/Demio is a subcompact car made by Mazda. This version is built on the new DE platform, which Ford also used for the 2008 Ford Fiesta. It deploys light weight material and reduces the overall dimensions of the car. The North American version of the Mazda2 was unveiled at the LA Auto Show 2009, making it Mazda''s first subcompact in North America since the 323 was discontinued in the United States in 1994 (1995 in Canada). The North American version became available in July 2010 for a starting price of $13,980 USD. The only engine available is the 1.5-liter, 100-horsepower four-cylinder matched to a 5-speed manual or 4-speed automatic transmission. The Mazda 2 received a Good rating from the Insurance Institute for Highway Safety in frontal crashes, Acceptable for side crashes, Good for roof strength, and Acceptable for rear crash protection. . I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! @Ferrari: Yes, from a GTA: SA mod file.',NULL,'mazda','2011','2',4.501616477966310371,2.183908104896549852,2.222105264663699842,'green',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(98,'f770402300ccb66d94db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','1983 Nissan/Datsun 300ZX Z31','The Nissan 300ZX is a sports car made by Nissan. The Z31 chassis designation was first introduced in 1983 as a 1984 Nissan/Datsun 300ZX (the hatch lid had both a Datsun badge and a Nissan badge) in the US only. The 300ZX, as its predecessors, was known as a Nissan in other parts of the world. This continued in the US until 1985 model year when Nissan standardized their brand name worldwide and dropped the Datsun badge. A note can be made that all publications for the Z31 chassis 300ZX and its predecessors were copyright Nissan North America. Designed by Kazumasu Takagi and his team of developers, the 300ZX improved aerodynamics and increased power when compared to its predecessor, the 280ZX. The newer Z-car had a drag coefficient of 0.30 and was powered by Japan''s first mass-produced V6 engine instead of an I6. According to Nissan, the V6 engine was supposed to re-create the spirit of the original Fairlady Z. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. I improved it almost entirely. Please rate!',NULL,NULL,'1983',NULL,3.7743060588836701,1.631330132484440032,1.079170758021060105,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f770402300ccb66d94db926ad0cd7381/1983-NissanDatsun-300ZX-Z31',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(99,'ede2fbac4ee84bdc87676a945c82c0fd','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Audi R8 Spyder (Low Poly)','The Audi R8 Spyder is a sports roadster made by Audi. In August 2008, spy shots of a convertible R8 Spider from filming scenes of the movie Iron Man 2 were published online. The photos showed a clearly visible soft-top roof, and the unique sideblade had been removed. The vehicle was formally unveiled at the 2009 Frankfurt Motor Show. Compared with the coup model, the convertible will have extra chassis support, a pair of roll-over safety bars, as well as minor changes such as the location of the fuel tank filler. It will be powered by a 5.2 FSI V10 engine. On July 1, 2010 Autocar reported that Audi has added the 4.2 FSI V8 engine to the R8 Spyder range. The 434 PS (319 kW; 428 bhp) (up 14 bhp on coup), 430 newton metres (317 lbfft) unit now completes the R8 Spyder range alongside the launch V10 powerplant. It has a 0-62 mph (0100 km/h) time of 4.8sec and will go on to reach a top speed of 185 mph (299 km/h). The engine is available with Audi''s R tronic sequential manual gearbox. Like the V10 model, the V8 Spyder features an aluminium spaceframe with carbon composites and an automatic retractable folding cloth roof. I found this in a Zmodeler file, and the model is ripped from NFS: Shift 2, along with the high-quality model. I improved it a lot. Please rate!',NULL,'audi','2008','r8 spyder',4.694766759872440077,2.183907985687259857,1.270786046981809969,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/ede2fbac4ee84bdc87676a945c82c0fd/2008-Audi-R8-Spyder-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(100,'a484e8b4e9f26cf994db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Dodge Grand Caravan SXT','The Dodge Caravan is a family minivan manufactured by Chrysler Group LLC and sold under its Dodge brand. Beginning with Generation V in model year 2008, Chrysler only made the long wheelbase Grand Caravan. This van debuted at the 2007 North American International Auto Show and had exterior styling by Ralph Gilles. With discontinuation of the short-wheelbase Caravan, Dodge offered the Journey on nearly an identical wheelbase and as a crossover rather than a minivan. Although the SWB model, which had accounted for half of all sales in Canada, cost approximately $2,000 less and offered a four-cylinder engine option with improved fuel economy, Chrysler executives stated the SWB Caravan was discontinued to accommodate new features offered in the Grand Caravan, consistent with the demands of the majority of the minivan market. I imported this from a GTA IV file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. This is also ripped from Need for Speed: Hot Pursuit, because the Grand Caravan appears as a traffic car there. I improved it a lot, because many of the parts were ungrouped. Please rate!',NULL,'dodge','2008','grand caravan',4.912866592407230116,2.183907985687259857,1.664810895919800027,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a484e8b4e9f26cf994db926ad0cd7381/2008-Dodge-Grand-Caravan-SXT',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(101,'3b1d049eb8ba2524be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2000 Mercedes-Benz C180 Kompressor W203 (Low Poly)','The Mercedes-Benz C-Class is a compact executive car produced by Mercedes-Benz. The second generation C-Class was introduced in March 2000. The sedan debuted with a range of inline-four and V6 petrol engines and inline-four and -five diesels. Most of the engines were carried over from the W202, but the C 320 was exclusive, offering 160 kW (218 PS). The diesels now featured common rail direct fuel injection and variable geometry turbochargers. Six-speed manual gearboxes were now standard for the entire range, except the C 320. Notably, for the first time, the number designations were no longer equivalent to the engine displacement, more specifically in the C 200 (1.8-litre), C 240 (2.6-litre) and C 200 CDI (2.2-litre). I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. I improved it. Wheels, Guide Model and Hood Ornament by Mitchieboy. Please rate! #auto #automobile #benz #cklasse #c180 #car #compact #european #executive #german #kompressor #luxury #mercedes #xrw960h',NULL,'mercedes-benz','2000','c180 kompressor',4.763451576232910156,2.100486516952510208,1.516477378085260063,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/3b1d049eb8ba2524be40bb45ea25a041/2000-MercedesBenz-C180-Kompressor-W203-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(102,'3a38ad006602a97ea658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Chevrolet Montana Sport','The Chevrolet Montana is a subcompact coup utility produced by GM Brasil. In October of 2010, Chevrolet presented the second generation Montana, now based on the Chevrolet Agile. The Montana has some elements borrowed from the Agile, like the front styling. The entry-level trim, the Conquest was replaced by the LS, and the top-of-the-line trim is now the Sport. From now, Chevrolet currently only offers the 1.4 Econoflex engine, but it could receive new engines in the future. The previous generation was sold in Venezuela, but currently, this version isn''t offered. It is currently being sold at most Mercosur countries (like Argentina, Chile, etc.). I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. I fixed and improved it. Please rate! #agile #auto #automobile #brasil #brazilian #car #chevrolet #chevy #coupe #mercosur #montana #pickup #subcompact #utility #xrw960h','matte glass','chevrolet','2011','montana sport',5.028685092926029831,2.159849882125850052,1.805133001878860055,'blue',NULL,'truck','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/3a38ad006602a97ea658426ef34a90c8/2011-Chevrolet-Montana-Sport',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(103,'92a28276461d326ebe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Nissan Juke (Low Poly)','The Nissan Juke is a mini-crossover produced by Nissan from 2010 to present. The Juke was designed at Nissan Design Europe in London and refined at Nissan''s Design Centre in Japan. It is based on the Nissan B platform. The car''s profile is dominated by the prominent wheel arches and the body''s high waistline which contrast with the slim side windows. Echoing a style first seen on the Maxima, Nissan''s high performance electric coup concept shown at the 2007 Frankfurt Auto Show, the glasshouse resembles a crash helmet visor. A coup-like appearance is achieved by the rear door handles being located near the C-pillars, within the window frame. The sport motif continues inside with the red- or grey-painted centre console bearing similarity to a motorcycle fuel tank. It is also noticeable for its headlights, which are located on top of the front hood rather than on the front of the hood. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. I improved it a little. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #crossover','matte glass','nissan','2011','juke',3.450971364974980027,1.607892990112300025,1.243806377053259916,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/92a28276461d326ebe40bb45ea25a041/2011-Nissan-Juke-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(104,'cf1bd46660ab9ae0be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Hyundai Genesis Coup (Low Poly)','The Hyundai Genesis Coup is a mid-size coup produced by Hyundai Motor Company. The front bumper and hood received a styling revision that incorporates Hyundai''s fluidic corporate design language, sharing details with the Veloster. Transmission choices include an 8-speed automatic transmission with paddle-shifters or a 6-speed manual transmission. In response to criticisms about materials quality from reviewers and owners, Hyundai significantly improved materials quality for the new model. New features include a leather handbrake handle, plasmacluster air filtering, red leather interior option, LED accents above the foglights, and LED taillights. I 100% made this in Blender 2.49b, from my model, using the Polygon Reducer add-on that it included. I added and fixed details, it has elements from the high poly version, like the wheels, mirrors, spoiler and wheels. I''m quite proud of this. I''ll try to post a tutorial in Google+. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #coup #design #fluidic #genesis #hyundai #korean #midsize #sculpture #sport','triangles','hyundai','2013','genesis',4.472720623016360086,2.015585899353030008,1.312018940225240016,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/cf1bd46660ab9ae0be40bb45ea25a041/2013-Hyundai-Genesis-Coup-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(105,'b2b22a1454f2c88bf63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Hyundai Veracruz/ix55','The Hyundai Veracruz, or ix55 in Europe, is a mid-size, 7-seater crossover SUV. The Veracruz gets its name from a state in Mexico, continuing the Western theme from the small Tucson SUV and mid-size Hyundai Santa Fe SUV. Powering the Veracruz is a 3.8 L 263 hp (196 kW) V6 engine with an Aisin sourced 6-speed Shiftronic Automatic transmission. In Europe was sold only with 3.0 L CRDI V6 diesel S-Line engine with Variable geometry turbocharger and 240 hp (180 kW). In 2008, the Veracruz was also sold in some European countries as the ix55. I imported this from a GTA IV file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #crossover #hyundai #ix55 #midsize #outdoor #sport #suv #veracruz #xrw960h',NULL,'hyundai','2008','ix55',5.076409578323359816,2.183907985687259857,1.848397016525270108,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/b2b22a1454f2c88bf63ee8a34069b7c5/2008-Hyundai-Veracruzix55',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(106,'703a4673135c962ea658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Lexus CT 200h','The Lexus CT 200h is an hybrid electric 5-door entry-level luxury hatchback produced by Toyota under the Lexus brand. It made its debut at the March 2010 Geneva Auto Show, six months after the unveiling of the LF-Ch concept car; it is primarily targeted at the European market but is being sold worldwide and was introduced to North American markets at the April 2010 New York International Auto Show. The CT 200h is powered by the same 1.8 litre VVT-i four-cylinder petrol engine (Toyota''s 2ZR-FXE) as used in the Auris and Prius, producing 73 kW (98 hp) and 142 Nm (105 lbfft) of torque, paired with electric motor/generators in the hybrid drive system; together the engine and electric motors produce up to 100 kW (134 hp) and 207 Nm (153 lbfft) of torque along with a continuously variable transmission. I found this in a Zmodeler file, and the model is ripped from Forza Motorsport 4. I improved it a lot. Please rate! #200h #auto #automobile #car #ct #entrylevel #grille #hatchback #japanese #lexus #lfch #luxurious #luxury #spindle #stylish #toyota',NULL,'lexus','2011','ct',4.683012008666990412,2.183908104896549852,1.693177103996279965,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/703a4673135c962ea658426ef34a90c8/2011-Lexus-CT-200h',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(107,'91839bfa518b94d6be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Alfa Romeo Giulietta (Type 940)','The Alfa Romeo Giuletta is a small family car produced by Alfa Romeo Automobiles S.p.A.. It is the replacement for the Alfa Romeo 147. Giulietta production started towards the end of 2009 and was introduced at the March 2010 Geneva Motor Show. In a viability plan forwarded to the US Government in February 2009, Chrysler (a partner of Alfa Romeo parent company Fiat) reported that the 147 replacement would come to market as the Milano and that it could be built in the USA. However, as of early 2010 Fiat was instead planning to concentrate on bringing larger models to the US, such as the Giulia. The Giulietta came in second place in the 2011 European Car of the Year awards. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. It hasn''t interior. Please rate! #alfa #auto #automobile #car #compact #family #giulietta #italian #romeo #small #xrw960h',NULL,'alfa romeo','2010','giulietta',4.842440128326419568,2.183908104896549852,1.904949545860290083,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/91839bfa518b94d6be40bb45ea25a041/2010-Alfa-Romeo-Giulietta-Type-940',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(108,'e731298222f45deb661fd70b32ff741f','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Dodge Forza LX','The Dodge Forza is a subcompact sedan made by Fiat/Dodge for the Venezuelan Market. It was presented today (June 11th 2013) to journalists at Valencia, Carabobo. It is a rebadged Fiat Siena Tetrafuel that was originally sold in Venezuela only in 2010. The Forza will be one of the most affordable cars in Venezuela. The Forza will be available in two versions, LX and LE, both equipped with an iPod connection, USB port, 4-speaker audio system and MyCar infotainment system that features a clock, fuel selector and scheduled maintenance alerts Km/day. It''s available engine will be a 1.4 4-cyl engine mated to a 5-speed manual transmission, hydraulical steering, front ventilated discs and rear drum brake. 44.9 million of US$ were invested for equipment updating and assembly line of the plant located at Valencia, Carabobo, where it is currently being produced the Jeep Grand Cherokee and Cherokee. It''s slogan is The strength you need to achieve the distances. This is a modified model of a Fiat Siena i imported from a GTA SA file (credit to Maciel, original author), and i improved it entirely. Please rate! (Fun fact: the car was presented today, but i knew how the design would end up, thank to spy shots)',NULL,'dodge','2013','forza lx',4.762528419494629794,2.123257398605349789,1.602881706785409977,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/e731298222f45deb661fd70b32ff741f/2013-Dodge-Forza-LX',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(109,'47ff825bb43d37bbf63ee8a34069b7c5','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2005 Toyota Yaris/Vitz','The Toyota Yaris/Vitz is a subcompact hatchback made by Toyota Motor Company. Toyota redesigned the Vitz in early 2005, going on sale in Japan that February. The Toyota Belta sedan, shares underpinnings with the Vitz. However, while the Vitz was designed at Toyota''s European ED2 design studios, the Belta was designed at their Japanese design studios. While the outgoing Vitz hatchback and Platz sedan look and feel virtually alike, the redesigned Vitz and Belta are more subtly related. The two cars share a frame and the drivetrain components however the sheet metal is different. In Venezuela, it was sold from the end of 2005 to 2009. Original by lone_wolf29. I did cleaned it completely and made some little changes. Please rate! #auto #car #charade #daihatsu #subcompact #supermini #toyota #vitz #xrw960h #yaris',NULL,'toyota','2005',NULL,4.124100208282469815,2.156399965286249997,1.640738415531810101,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/47ff825bb43d37bbf63ee8a34069b7c5/2005-Toyota-YarisVitz',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(110,'ff0e576875fb6116be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','Audi A1 Clubsport Quattro','The Audi A1 is a supermini made by Audi AG. In May 2011, the A1 clubsport quattro concept car was shown at the Wrthersee event. This car has a modified version of the Audi RS 3''s five-cylinder 2.5 L engine tuned to 503 PS (370 kW) and 660 Nm (487 lbft). Capable of 0 to 100 km/h (0 to 62 mph) acceleration in 3.7 seconds, the car also features a restyled exterior including blister-style extended wheelarches reminiscent of the Audi Quattro and minimal, lightweight interior trim. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Fully detailed with phototextured carbon fibre. Please rate! #a1 #audi #auto #automobile #car #clubsport #event #fast #modified #quattro #racing #small #tuning #worthersee #xrw960h',NULL,'audi',NULL,'a1 clubsport quattro',4.673885107040409714,2.183908104896549852,1.707298994064329945,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/ff0e576875fb6116be40bb45ea25a041/Audi-A1-Clubsport-Quattro',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(111,'83731bad1b7d6ec531fde3a1e19a4940','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2004 Chevrolet Optra/Daewoo Lacetti Hatchback','The Daewoo Lacetti or Chevrolet Optra is a compact car made by the South Korean automaker GM Daewoo since 2002. The first-generation Lacetti was available as a four-door sedan, a five-door hatchback or a five-door station wagon. The sedan and wagon were designed by Pininfarina, and the hatchback by Giorgetto Giugiaro. The hatchback, known as Lacetti5 in South Korea, was introduced in summer 2004. It is also sold as Suzuki Reno or Forenza, Buick Excelle (the hatchback is called Excelle HRV), Holden Viva, Chevrolet Lacetti and Daewoo Nubira. On Venezuela, this version was sold from 2006 to 2009 and it''s as popular as the sedan. I found it on 3delicious.net. Please rate! (Edit as of 12/12/12: Improved the overall model and added small details) #auto #buick #car #chevrolet #compact #daewoo #excelle #forenza #holden #hrv #international #lacetti #optra #reno #suzuki #viva #world #xrw960h',NULL,'chevrolet','2004',NULL,5.142834663391109729,2.183908224105830076,2.041013479232789862,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/83731bad1b7d6ec531fde3a1e19a4940/2004-Chevrolet-OptraDaewoo-Lacetti-Hatchback',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(112,'5c637365f8be7b69be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2005 Toyota Vios','The Toyota Vios is a 4-door subcompact sedan developed for the South East Asia, China, and Taiwan markets. The first generation Vios was assembled at Thailand''s 1 million square metre Toyota Gateway Plant in Gateway City, Amphoe Plaeng Yao, Chachoengsao Province, as part of a cooperative project between Thai engineers and Toyota''s Japanese designers. The first generation Vios was adapted from the Toyota Platz with modified body panels, which created a significantly different appearance, although portions of the car feature design cues from the E120 Corolla. In late 2005, the Vios received minor cosmetic changes for the 2006 model year. The front bumper, grille, headlights, and tail lights were freshened; also new were the wheels and interior trim. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Wheels by www.drive3dautos.com. Please rate! #asian #auto #automobile #car #compact #indonesian #japanese #market #philippine #sedan',NULL,'toyota','2005','vios',4.695772171020509588,2.073933362960819871,1.589692226029000067,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/5c637365f8be7b69be40bb45ea25a041/2005-Toyota-Vios',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(113,'afd93b5535375814be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Toyota Vellfire/Alphard','The Toyota Vellfire is a luxury large minivan produced by Toyota Motor Company and it''s a variant of the Alphard. In April 2008, the Alphard was redesigned with a more modern style of exterior and a more luxurious interior. For this generation, the Alphard line-up was expanded into two different design variant - Alphard and Vellfire. According to Toyota''s press release, the Alphard is described as having elegant and sophisticated design while the Vellfire emphasizes on strength and strong individuality. Both models are sold via separate distribution channels, with the Alphard sold by Toyota''s Toyopet dealership chain while the Vellfire is sold at Toyota''s youth oriented Netz dealership chain. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and recolored some parts. Please rate! @DennisP: Read my review on the Audi A8. #alphard #auto #automobile #big #car #japanese #large #luxury #minivan #mpv #spacious #toyota #vellfire #xrw960h',NULL,'toyota','2008',NULL,4.797814846038820135,2.183908104896549852,1.848603010177610084,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/afd93b5535375814be40bb45ea25a041/2008-Toyota-VellfireAlphard',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(114,'e01580b99b583007661fd70b32ff741f','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Peugeot 308 5-Door (Low Poly)','The Peugeot 308 is a small family car made by Peugeot. It was unveiled on 5 June 2007 and launched in September 2007. Its development code was Project T7, and is the first car of the X08 generation of Peugeot models. The 308 features a range of petrol and diesel engine options. Launched as the replacement for the Peugeot 307 in most international markets, the new vehicle was based upon the old 307s chassis, but has new bodywork and is slightly longer and wider. Its coefficient of drag is 0.29, and it has a five-star Euro NCAP rating. I made this the same way as the Ferrari FF, but this time i converted the 308 GTi to a normal 2008 308. I edited it a lot to make it really low poly. Please rate! #308 #auto #automobile #csegment #car #coupe #family #french #hatchback #peugeot #rcz #small #station #wagon #xrw960h','triangles','peugeot','2008','308',4.360651493072509766,2.090175151824949839,1.818170604296029947,'gray',NULL,'passenger',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(115,'39318a9191f106eabe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Chevrolet Aveo5 LT/ Daewoo Gentra X (T250)','The Chevrolet Aveo s a subcompact car produced by Chevrolet since 2002. A restyled hatchback with the sedan''s updated instrument panel was presented as the Chevrolet Aveo during the Frankfurt Motor Show 2007, to be marketed in Europe and North America. The Korean market''s restyle of the hatchback, the Gentra X, featured a less distinct/more normal grille treatment that formed the basis for the Holden, Pontiac and Suzuki-branded variants. Later iterations, including the Kalos, Aveo, Barina and Gentra sedans, the Gentra X hatchback and the 2007 Frankfurt Show hatchbacks were styled in-house and with the assistance of PATAC, and depart notably from the original Giugiaro exterior and interior styling designs. In Venezuela, the Aveo is one of the best-selling subcomapct cars ever, and became a popular car since it''s introduction. The 5-door version of this facelift was never sold in Venezuela, but instead, the 3-door variant. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. Please rate! @nico: El Aveo tambien es popular aqui en Venezuela! Una tia mia tiene uno de 4 puertas, pero no el que es de lavado de cara, el original. Aqui es inevitable ver un Aveo.',NULL,'chevrolet','2010','aveo',4.282138347625729757,2.183907866477969862,1.735919117927549938,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/39318a9191f106eabe40bb45ea25a041/2010-Chevrolet-Aveo5-LT-Daewoo-Gentra-X-T250',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(116,'61013c38e3b212792a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Lexus LFA','The Lexus LFA is a 2-seat exotic sports coupe produced by Lexus as a concept car, halo vehicle, racing prototype, and production model. It is the second model in the F marque line of performance vehicles from Lexus, following the IS F. Three concept versions have been shown, each debuting at the North American International Auto Show with the LF-A designation as part of the LF Series concept line. The first LF-A concept premiered in 2005, followed in 2007 by a second LF-A with a more completely furnished interior and exterior. The third version of the LF-A, a roadster model, premiered in 2008. The production model, trademarked LFA, was shown at the Tokyo Motor Show in October 2009. I found it on the internet. I improved it. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #coup #grand #halo #lexus #lfa #luxury #sports #tourer #xrw960h',NULL,'lexus','2011','lfa',4.474459171295169568,1.849871277809139958,1.187834262847889954,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/61013c38e3b212792a9eb0f146e94477/2011-Lexus-LFA',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(117,'5834b28bdfa03b0394db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2007 Dodge Caliber (Low Poly)','The Dodge Caliber is a compact car made by Dodge from 2006 to 2012. It replaced the Neon, which Chrysler had discontinued in 2005. The Caliber went on sale in March 2006 as a five-door hatchback, but with its appearance it is sometimes considered a station wagon or a crossover. The Caliber was the smallest and the least expensive vehicle in the brand''s line-up until it was succeeded by the smaller 2013 Dart. The Caliber was an important vehicle for Chrysler in its quest to expand globally. The Caliber was one of Dodge''s first modern offerings in Europe and in Asian markets such as Japan and Singapore, as it established new distribution channels there. It was also introduced in China in 2008 as Dodge''s second modern vehicle offering in that market. Dodge vehicles were last officially sold in China during the World War II era. The introduction of the Caliber had marked the return of the Dodge brand to Australia, for the first time since the early 1970s. In Venezuela, it proved to be a really good seller, being one of the most known cars here. As of 2013, the Caliber is still sold in Venezuela, with the only version offered being the SXT. It is assembled at Chrysler Group''s assembly plant located in Valencia, Carabobo. A total of 1.049 Calibers were sold in Venezuela in 2012. I ripped this from Need for Speed: Most Wanted (2012), while i found that there are two versions of the models, low and high poly. Used ZModeler 3.0.3. Please rate!',NULL,'dodge','2007','caliber',4.615650177001949572,2.175262928009030095,1.581663264689270098,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/5834b28bdfa03b0394db926ad0cd7381/2007-Dodge-Caliber-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(118,'f7fcb0a7d6e99b9094db926ad0cd7381','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2010 Honda Insight Hybrid','The Honda Insight is a compact hybrid car made by Honda. In 2009, Honda introduced its second-generation Insight based on an all-new, 5-passenger, 5-door, dedicated hybrid platform, which was also later used for the Honda CR-Z. The concept version of the Insight hatchback hybrid electric vehicle had made its public debut at the 2008 Paris Motor Show. The 2010 Honda Insight was specifically designed to make hybrid technology more affordable to a wide range of buyers. Departing from the first generation Insights two-seat configuration, the 2010 Insight is a 5-passenger, 5-door dedicated hybrid vehicle that includes the fifth generation of Hondas Integrated Motor Assist (IMA) hybrid powertrain. This is a subdivided and detailed version of a model i downloaded from MTSUKADA CG''s website. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #comapct #honda #hybrid #innovative #insight #japanese #shaped #wedge #xrw960h',NULL,'honda','2010','insight',4.637777328491210049,2.13482666015625,1.516512123867870043,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f7fcb0a7d6e99b9094db926ad0cd7381/2010-Honda-Insight-Hybrid',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(119,'e006d64252e924c1be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Mazda CX-5','The Mazda CX-5 is a compact crossover SUV produced by Mazda. It is Mazda''s first car featuring the new KODO - Soul of Motion Design language first shown in the Shinari concept vehicle in May 2010. It is also the first vehicle featuring the company''s full Skyactiv Technology suite, featuring a rigid, lightweight platform, combined with a new series of efficient engines and transmissions resulting in reduced emissions and fuel consumption. The Skyactiv Engine and Transmission Technologies were released in the 2012 Mazda3 compact sedan and hatchback. I found it on a japanese website and it was originally a .lwo file. I improved it. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #crossover #cx5 #japanese #kodo #mazda #minagi #motion #of #skyactiv #soul #suv #xrw960h',NULL,'mazda','2013','cx-5',4.660083770751949573,2.183908104896549852,1.744586825370789906,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/e006d64252e924c1be40bb45ea25a041/2013-Mazda-CX5',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(120,'20cb27761f7af65be40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Suzuki Alto (JDM Version)','The Suzuki Alto is a kei-car produced by Suzuki from 1979 to present. The 7th Generation was first shown at the 2009 Tokyo Motor Show alongside its sister car, the Mazda Carol. In 2011, Suzuki launched the Alto Eco variant, that features the R06A engine lifted from the Suzuki MR Wagon and an idling stop function. It is capable of reaching the fuel economy of 30.2 km/L (71MPG) based on Japan''s JC08 Mode test cycle. This is .2 km/L higher than the Daihatsu Mira e:S. Suzuki evolved a New Model Alto K10. Powered by three-cylinder units displacing 998cc. The engine is one of the best units in it class and is the only 1.0 litre twin cam engine available. The engine produces 68PS at 6200rpm and a healthy torque rating of 90Nm at 3500rpm. Car has 5-speed transmissions and is smooth to operate. However the Alto''s feels a tad better to use. The engine too is more refined and not as harsh as contemporaries. The power to weight figure is an impressive 88.88PS per tonne. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. Please rate!',NULL,'suzuki','2011','alto',4.182144165039059836,2.183908104896549852,1.876585841178890046,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/20cb27761f7af65be40bb45ea25a041/2011-Suzuki-Alto-JDM-Version',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(121,'a3881c3f4e8c807f2a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2011 Chevrolet Cruze 5-Door','GM in 2008 introduced the Cruze compact car, carrying the J300 internal designation. This J300 iteration serves as a replacement for the Chevrolet Cobalt and Daewoo Lacettiboth unrelated cars. The first renderings of the Cruze were revealed by GM at a press conference on July 15, 2008, with the first official images released on August 21, 2008. Original by azrielnation. Modified it to look more realistic. Please rate! #5door #azrielnation #chevrolet #compact #cruze #daewoo #hatch #hatchback #holden #J300 #lacetti #new #nice #premiere #xrw960h','triangles','chevrolet','2011','cruze',4.555045604705809658,2.16864562034606978,1.497576475143429952,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/a3881c3f4e8c807f2a9eb0f146e94477/2011-Chevrolet-Cruze-5Door',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(122,'f81e29afce98ada6b6a9b47baee81a97','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 BMW F10 M5 (Low Poly)','The BMW M5 is a high-performance executive car made by BMW. The F10 M5 was released to the public at the 2011 Frankfurt Motor Show, and went on sale in November 2011. Compared to the preceding E60 M5 (and the E60 5 Series as a whole), The new F10 M5 is all about the right balance. It still favors its racing edge but can now be a very sophisticated executive car. Nonetheless, the F10 M5 is significantly heavier, has synthetic engine noise played through its audio system and has a lower top speed compared to the naturally aspirated E60 M5 V10 it replaces. The car features standard blue-painted brake calipers and 19 inch multi spoke wheels; 20 inch split 5 spoke wheels will also be available at launch. In an effort to lower the curb weight of the new M5, which is heavier than the E60 it relaced, BMW partnered with SGL group, a carbon fiber manufacturer. Despite this, the F10 still weighs significantly more than the E60 model and has faced criticism from some quarters for this, it''s relative lack of engine note and lack of steering feel compared to its immediate predecessor. Originally made by Captain Swallows from TurboSquid. If it happens to have a big file size, it''s because the wheels and headlights, and by the way i improved a lot the original mesh. Converted from Blender to SketchUp. BMW badges by tm. Please rate!',NULL,'bmw','2012','f10 m5',4.989528179168700284,2.183908104896549852,1.536696195602420101,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f81e29afce98ada6b6a9b47baee81a97/2012-BMW-F10-M5-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(123,'adc7890da45d7aabbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2008 Chevrolet Aveo LT/ Daewoo Gentra Sedan (T250)','The Chevrolet Aveo s a subcompact car produced by Chevrolet since 2002. GM introduced a revised sedan at Auto Shanghai 2005, designed in cooperation with PATAC. Bearing the internal code T250 and sold in South Korea as the Daewoo Gentra, the revision comprised primarily interior and exterior styling changes, a new interior instrument panel and minor equipment changes, including increased sound deadening. Incorporation of the radio antenna into the rear glass and extensive wind tunnel testing helped reduce the coefficient of drag from 0.348 to 0.326. In Venezuela, the Aveo is one of the best-selling subcomapct cars ever, and became a popular car since it''s introduction. This version was launched in late 2007, while the facelifted 3-door came in late 2010. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. It doesn''t have the headlight glasses. Please rate! #american #auto #automobile #aveo #car #chevrolet #daewoo #gentra #hatchback #korean',NULL,NULL,'2008',NULL,5.092144966125490058,2.183908104896549852,1.807560324668880059,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/adc7890da45d7aabbe40bb45ea25a041/2008-Chevrolet-Aveo-LT-Daewoo-Gentra-Sedan-T250',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(124,'32ff3311149ca8eabe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2006 Toyota Corolla Fielder (Low Poly)','The Toyota Corolla Fielder is a compact station wagon produced by Toyota Motor Company. The tenth generation Corolla (E140) was released in Japan on October 10, 2006. The station wagon retains the Corolla Fielder name, as it was called also Corolla Fielder in it''s previous generation. To save neck-twisting, the Corolla gets Toyota''s latest intelligent parking-assist system. The option costs 105,000, or $879 at current exchange rates. A backup camera monitor is standard. I found it on a japanese website (MTSUKADA CG) and it was originally a .lwo file. I added missing details, like the wheels and logos. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #compact #corolla #estate #fielder #japan #japanese #station #toyota #wagon #xrw960h',NULL,'toyota','2006','corolla',4.701343536376949573,2.083507299423219993,1.480409145355219947,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/32ff3311149ca8eabe40bb45ea25a041/2006-Toyota-Corolla-Fielder-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(125,'f621454564302f6abe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Renault Espace IV (Low Poly)','The Renault Espace is a large MPV made by Renault. The fourth generation Espace arrived in 2003 and was the first entirely Renault-developed and produced model. The Espace is 90% recyclable and contains numerous weight-reducing materials, thus cutting fuel consumption. The aluminium doors and bonnet are some 20 kg lighter than steel equivalents. Its styling was reflective of a new design direction at Renault, symbolised by the radical Vel Satis and Avantime models, marking a major departure from the previous model, which also saw the range moved upmarket. In 25th of June of 2012, Renault announced a facelift version that will be in the market until the new Espace V appears. This facelift involves Renault''s new styling direction, having in the front a redesigned bumper, bigger logo, and other details. Original by ZBpM. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #espace #ii #iv #large #mpv #phase #renault #renewed #renovated #spacious #xrw960h',NULL,'renault','2013','espace',4.598077297210689807,2.163468599319459785,1.786255160812290077,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f621454564302f6abe40bb45ea25a041/2013-Renault-Espace-IV-Low-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(126,'79fdc1e5a1b40b8fbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Hyundai Genesis Coup 3.8','The Hyundai Genesis Coup is a mid-size coup produced by Hyundai Motor Company. The front bumper and hood received a styling revision that incorporates Hyundai''s fluidic corporate design language, sharing details with the Veloster. Transmission choices include an 8-speed automatic transmission with paddle-shifters or a 6-speed manual transmission. In response to criticisms about materials quality from reviewers and owners, Hyundai significantly improved materials quality for the new model. New features include a leather handbrake handle, plasmacluster air filtering, red leather interior option, LED accents above the foglights, and LED taillights. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp. I added some details. I''m making a very lower poly version. Please rate! #auto #automobile #car #coup #design #fluidic #genesis #hyundai #korean #midsize #sculpture #sport #veloster #xrw960h',NULL,'hyundai','2013','genesis coup 3.8',4.746509075164789593,2.183908104896549852,1.415059924125670055,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/79fdc1e5a1b40b8fbe40bb45ea25a041/2013-Hyundai-Genesis-Coup-38',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(127,'3b55921c56a022bdbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2006 Renault Clio III Phase I (High Poly)','The Renault Clio is a supermini made by Renault. An all-new third generation Clio was unveiled at the 2005 Frankfurt Motor Show. The Clio III uses the Nissan B platform, co-developed with Nissan (which Renault has a share in), that is shared with the Renault Modus, the current Nissan Micra and the Nissan Note. It is considerably larger and 130 kg (287 lb) heavier as well as more expensive than the Clio II, and at nearly 4000 mm in length has almost outgrown the supermini class. I imported this from a GTA: SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and i recolored some parts. Please rate! @NENTAUTAKO: I would like to import cars from that game, but unfortunately there seems that ZModeler hasn''t an option for GRID. I will see what i could do. #auto #automobile #car #clio #euroclio #french #good #looking #lutecia #phase_i #renault #small #supermini #xrw960h',NULL,'renault','2006','clio',4.164911508560179775,2.064775943756099962,1.804045677185059926,'blue',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/3b55921c56a022bdbe40bb45ea25a041/2006-Renault-Clio-III-Phase-I-High-Poly',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(128,'f31eae8f1f64638c2a9eb0f146e94477','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2012 Fiat Palio','An all-new generation of Palio was revealed in October 2011 at the annual Fiat dealers meeting in Mykonos, Greece; however, the official launch took place at November 4. It is the first total remodeling since launch in 1997. The project (under code 326) was anticipated because of the success of the new Fiat Uno in Brazil. One of the new versions will be Sporting - brand known by the sportive versions of Siena, Uno, Idea, Bravo and Strada. Original by rodolfo. I did some small changes, adding a little realistic look. Please rate! #allnew #atractive #auto #car #essence #fiat #hatchback #new #new_palio #not_stolen #novo_palio #nuevo_palio #p326 #palio #remodeling #reworked #rodolfo #sporting #xrw960h','triangles','fiat','2012','palio',4.410174369812009943,2.127828478813170055,1.685690995305779927,'yellow',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f31eae8f1f64638c2a9eb0f146e94477/2012-Fiat-Palio',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(129,'b5c8e1a82ce2375ea658426ef34a90c8','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2013 Hyundai Veloster Turbo','The Hyundai Veloster Turbo is a compact 3-door hatchback/coup produced by Hyundai. The turbocharged version of the Veloster includes 1.6-liter turbocharged GDI four-cylinder engine rated for either 186 PS (137 kW; 183 hp) at 5,500 rpm or 150 kW (204 PS; 201 hp) at 6,000 rpm depending on market, and 27 kgm (265 Nm; 195 lbft) at 1,750-4,500 rpm, sport-tuned engine intake and exhaust note, sport-tuned steering, unique front fascia, foglights and ground effects, Hyundai-first Matte Gray paint, 18-inch alloy wheels with chrome inserts and Kumho Solus KH25 215/40R18 85V tires, projection headlights with unique LED headlight accents, side mirrors with turn signal indicators, LED taillights, supervision cluster, leather seating surfaces with driver''s lumbar support, heated front seats, turbo exclusive Graphite Black interior with Blue accents and headliner graphics. The Veloster Turbo was unveiled at the 2012 North American International Auto Show. I found this in a Zmodeler file, and the model is ripped from Forza Motorsport 4. I improved it a lot. Please rate! @Boekwurm: Yes, this is from MM2 Riva. I''ll be converting many more, i''m working on the Lexus CT 200h and the 2008 Ford Ka that were also on his website.',NULL,'hyundai','2013','veloster',4.682756900787349962,2.183908224105830076,1.573543071746829946,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/b5c8e1a82ce2375ea658426ef34a90c8/2013-Hyundai-Veloster-Turbo',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(130,'50e3333f66829c8fbe40bb45ea25a041','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2009 Hyundai Tucson ix35','The Hyundai Tucson or ix35 is a compact SUV made by Hyundai Motor Corporation. In most markets outside Korea, Hyundai ix35 (also called ''Hyundai Tucson ix'' in the Korean market) replaced Hyundai Tucson name. The ix35 was unveiled in 2009 Frankfurt Motor Show. The power output, fuel-efficiency, comfort and safety features have been all upgraded. Known by the project name LM, it took 36 months and 280 billion won (approx. US$225 million) to develop. The ix35''s styling was reported to be based on Hyundai ix-onic concept. The ix35 was penned by former BMW designer Thomas Buerkle at Hyundai''s Russelsheim design studio in Germany and continues the company''s styling language, marketed as fluidic sculpture. The compact sports utility vehicle has sweeping coupe-like lines, a premium vehicle feel and comes with features unavailable on its predecessor. I imported this from a GTA SA file using Zmodeler 2 and exported it to 3ds and imported it to SketchUp, regrouped and coloured everything. It''s original filesize was 18MB. It hasn''t interior or engine. Please rate! @Matt418: I don''t care of that, just scale it back to it''s 1:1 scale! I don''t know the measures of this Hyundai, so i can''t do anything. Oh, and i share, i''m not a professional modeller.',NULL,'hyundai','2009','ix35',4.491719245910640091,2.183908224105830076,1.791264533996580033,'red',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/50e3333f66829c8fbe40bb45ea25a041/2009-Hyundai-Tucson-ix35',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(131,'f06af3b73004c92ec7193c87bbfa9088','5f08583b1f45a9a7c7193c87bbfa9088','2004 Fiat Siena','The new Mk. III comes in 2004. The designer was again, Giorgetto Giugiaro. It has a new front, rear and interior design. The ''04 Siena was the very first Brazilian compact sedan with 4 airbags (2 at front and 2 sidebags), auto dimming rear view mirror, rain sensor and park assistance, etc. Anyhow all those accessories are very expensive for the Brazilian market and most South American markets so they can be considered just as catalog option or show window purposes only. The engines range in South America from a 1.3 Fire 16 valve, a new 1.4 Fire 8 valve with 80cv (the same of the latest Fiat Punto, and a 1.8 Powertrain 8 valve with 112cv, shared with the Chevrolet Corsa. Original by jojo. I did some adjustments. Please rate! #auto #brazil #car #compact #fiat #hwiparam #nanjingfiat #petra #pyonghwa #sedan #siena #xrw960h',NULL,'fiat','2004','siena',4.632658004760740412,2.183908224105830076,1.794863224029539905,'white',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f06af3b73004c92ec7193c87bbfa9088/2004-Fiat-Siena',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
