INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(1093,'7d203b0509276e0bc232ee2a314e7c1e','91f36aacbde112e168742254bcf1c9e9','Ford F-150 SuperCrew Raptor SVT 2011','For the 2010 model year, Ford introduced the SVT Raptor model of the F-150. Intended for dedicated off-road use, the Raptor has a number of modifications to improve its off-road ability. It wears a wider body and fenders than the standard F-Series truck. In 2011, a full 4-door SuperCrew model was added to the the standard 2+2 door SuperCab model. The Raptor is powered by a 411hp 6.2 L V8; it is paired with a 6-speed automatic transmission.','other','ford','2011','f-150',5.414862871170040393,7.58920288085936967,1.875858560204509918,'white',NULL,'truck','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/7d203b0509276e0bc232ee2a314e7c1e/Ford-F150-SuperCrew-Raptor-SVT-2011',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(1094,'f45cd996045929e0f2627e29d31e8d88','91f36aacbde112e168742254bcf1c9e9','2012 Dodge Charger SRT8','The 2012 Dodge Charger SRT8 uses the new 6.4-liter HEMI V-8, boasting 470 horsepower and 470 lb.-ft. of torque. A new active valve exhaust system allows the cylinder cutoff system to engage over a wider range, increasing gas mileage (by 25% on the highway), while an active intake manifold and high-lift camshaft with cam phasing provides maximum low-end torque for impressive standing starts while optimizing high-end power.',NULL,'dodge','2012','charger',4.842173576354979581,1.988139390945429908,1.429037219844760064,'gray',NULL,'passenger','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/f45cd996045929e0f2627e29d31e8d88/2012-Dodge-Charger-SRT8',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(1095,'4c18a991c14145108efc69f75162eba1','91f36aacbde112e168742254bcf1c9e9','2010 Ford F150','Seit Herbst 2008 steht der stark berarbeitete F-150 bei den amerikanischen Hndlern. Wie bereits die beiden Vorgnger, erhielt auch diese Modellgeneration im Jahr 2009 die Auszeichnung North American Truck of the Year.','triangles','ford','2010','f-150',5.983399629592899948,2.479139328002930132,2.003579493146390167,NULL,NULL,'truck','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/4c18a991c14145108efc69f75162eba1/2010-Ford-F150',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
INSERT INTO CadModel VALUES(1096,'97aebb2a9f7638a2e4806fd323e34b56','91f36aacbde112e168742254bcf1c9e9','GM GMT900 - GMC Sierra','The GMC Sierra (along with its counterpart, the Chevrolet Silverado) is a full-size pickup truck from General Motors. The redesigned GMT900 generation of the Silverado/Sierra arrived in the last quarter of 2006 as a 2007 model.',NULL,'gmc',NULL,'sierra',5.646177768707279832,2.040739297866819956,2.010156537333390059,'white',NULL,'truck','https://3dwarehouse.sketchup.com/model/97aebb2a9f7638a2e4806fd323e34b56/GM-GMT900-GMC-Sierra',NULL,NULL,'{"VehicleType":null}');
